  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And from its blessing #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] that it covers the servant's shameful things and his body's waste and hides them,
