  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And he #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] overpowered under the two rulings — they have been carried out upon him and executed upon him, whether he willed or refused.
