  فَهُوَ سُبْحَانَهُ يقْضِي مَا يقْضِي بِهِ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So He — glorified #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] He — decrees what He decrees.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَغَيره قد يقْضِي بِقَضَاء وَيقدر أَمر وَلَا يَسْتَطِيع تنفيذه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And other than Him may decree #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] decree and determine #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] matter, yet not be able to execute it.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَهُوَ سُبْحَانَهُ يقْضِي ويمضي فَلهُ الْقَضَاء والإمضاء
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And He — glorified #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] He — decrees and carries out, so to Him #text(fill: luma(120))[\[belongs\]] the decree and the execution.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَقَوله عدل فيَّ قضاؤك يتَضَمَّن جَمِيع أقضيته فِي عَبده من كل الْوُجُوه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And his saying 'Your decree upon me #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] just' includes all of His decrees upon His servant from every angle —
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  من صِحَة وسقم وغنى وفقر ولذّة وألم وحياة وَمَوْت وعقوبة وَتجَاوز وَغير ذَلِك
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  of health and illness, and wealth and poverty, and pleasure and pain, and life and death, and punishment and pardon, and other than that.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  قَالَ تَعَالَى وَمَا أَصَابَكُمْ مِنْ مُصِيبَة فِيمَا كسبت أَيْدِيكُم
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  #text(fill: luma(120))[\[God\]] Most High said: 'And whatever strikes you of hardship #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] because of what your hands have earned.'
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَقَالَ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And He said:
]

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿﴿وَإِنْ تُصِبْهُمْ سَيِّئَةٌ بِمَا قَدَّمَتْ أَيْدِيهِمْ فَإِنَّ الْأِنْسَانَ كفور﴾﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  And if #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] bad thing strikes them because of what their hands have put forward, then indeed man #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] ungrateful.
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [42:48] — Sahih Intl: But if they turn away - then We have not sent you, [O Muhammad], over them as a guardian; upon you is only [the duty of] notification. And indeed, when We let man taste mercy from us, he rejoices in it; but if evil afflicts him for what his hands have put forth, then indeed, man is ungrateful.
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَكل مَا يقْضى على العَبْد فَهُوَ عدل فِيهِ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So everything that #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] decreed upon the servant — it #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] justice upon him.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَإِن قيل فالمعصية عنْدكُمْ بِقَضَائِهِ وَقدره فَمَا وَجه الْعدْل فِي قَضَائهَا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So if it #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] said: 'Disobedience, according to you, #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] by His decree and His destiny — so what #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] the angle of justice in decreeing it?'
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَإِن الْعدْل فِي الْعقُوبَة عَلَيْهَا ظَاهر
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  'For the justice in punishing for it #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] clear.'
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  قيل هَذَا سُؤال لَهُ شَأْن
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  #text(fill: luma(120))[\[It is\]] said: this #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] a question of importance.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَمن أَجله زعمت طَائِفَة أَن الْعدْل هُوَ الْمَقْدُور وَالظُّلم مُمْتَنع لذاته
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And because of it, #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] group claimed that justice #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] whatever #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] decreed, and injustice #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] impossible in itself.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  قَالُوا لِأَن الظُّلم هُوَ التصرّف فِي ملك الْغَيْر
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  They said: 'Because injustice #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] acting in the property of another.'
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَالله لَهُ كل شَيْء فَلَا يكون تصرّفه فِي خلقه إِلَّا عدلا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  'And God owns everything, so His acting upon His creation can only be justice.'
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَقَالَت طَائِفَة بل الْعدْل أَنه لَا يُعَاقب على مَا قَضَاهُ وَقدره
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And #text(fill: luma(120))[\[another\]] group said: 'Rather, justice #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] that He does not punish for what He decreed and destined.'
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فلمّا حسن مِنْهُ الْعقُوبَة على الذَّنب عُلم أنّه لَيْسَ بِقَضَائِهِ وَقدره
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  'So since punishing for the sin #text(fill: luma(120))[\[was\]] fitting from Him, it #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] known that it #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] not by His decree and His destiny.'
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَيكون الْعدْل هُوَ جَزَاؤُهُ على الذَّنب بالعقوبة والذم
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  'So justice #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] His repaying the sin with punishment and blame —'
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  إِمَّا فِي الدُّنْيَا وَإِمَّا فِي الْآخِرَة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  either in this world or in the Hereafter.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وصعب على هَؤُلَاءِ الْجمع بَين الْعدْل وَبَين الْقدر
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And it #text(fill: luma(120))[\[was\]] difficult for these #text(fill: luma(120))[\[people\]] to combine between justice and destiny.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فزعموا أَن من أثبت الْقدر لم يُمكنهُ أَن يَقُول بِالْعَدْلِ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So they claimed that whoever affirmed destiny could not hold to justice,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَمن قَالَ بِالْعَدْلِ لم يُمكنهُ أَن يَقُول بِالْقدرِ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and whoever held to justice could not hold to destiny.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  كَمَا صَعب عَلَيْهِم الْجمع بَين التَّوْحِيد وَإِثْبَات الصِّفَات
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Just as it #text(fill: luma(120))[\[was\]] difficult for them to combine between monotheism and affirming the attributes #text(fill: luma(120))[\[of God\]].
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فزعموا أَنه لَا يُمكنهُم إِثْبَات التَّوْحِيد إِلَّا بإنكار الصِّفَات
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So they claimed that they could not affirm monotheism except by denying the attributes.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَصَارَ توحيدهم تعطيلا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So their monotheism became denial.
]
#align(right)[#text(7pt, fill: luma(170))[p. 24]]

// --- Page 23 (vol. page 25) ---


#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وعدلهم تَكْذِيبًا بِالْقدرِ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and their justice #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] a denial of #text(fill: luma(120))[\[divine\]] decree.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَأما أهل السّنة فهم مثبتون للأمرين
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  As for the people of the Sunnah, they affirm both matters.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَالظُّلم عِنْدهم هُوَ وضع الشَّيْء فِي غير مَوْضِعه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And wrongdoing according to them — it #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] placing #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] thing in other than its #text(fill: luma(120))[\[proper\]] place,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  كتعذيب الْمُطِيع وَمن لَا ذَنْب لَهُ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  like punishing the obedient one and the one who has no sin.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَهَذَا قد نزّه الله نَفسه عَنهُ فِي غير مَوضِع من كِتَابه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And this — God has declared Himself far above it in more than one place in His Book.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَهُوَ سُبْحَانَهُ وَإِن أضلّ من شَاءَ وَقضى بالمعصية والغي على من شَاءَ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And He, glorified #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] He, even if He misguided whom He willed and decreed disobedience and misguidance upon whom He willed —
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَذَلِك مَحْض الْعدْل فِيهِ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  then that #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] pure justice in it,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  لِأَنَّهُ وضع الإضلال والخذلان فِي مَوْضِعه اللَّائِق بِهِ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  because He placed the misguidance and the abandonment in its fitting place.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  كَيفَ وَمن أَسْمَائِهِ الْحسنى الْعدْل
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  How #text(fill: luma(120))[\[could it be otherwise\]] when among His most beautiful names #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] the Just —
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  الَّذِي كل أَفعاله وَأَحْكَامه سداد وصواب وَحقّ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  the One whose every action and ruling #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] sound, correct, and true.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَهُوَ سُبْحَانَهُ قد أوضح السبل وَأرْسل الرُّسُل وَأنزل الْكتب وأزاح الْعِلَل
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And He, glorified #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] He, has made clear the paths, sent the messengers, sent down the books, and removed the excuses,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ومكّن من أَسبَاب الْهِدَايَة وَالطَّاعَة بالأسماع والأبصار والعقول
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and enabled the means of guidance and obedience through hearing, sight, and minds.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَهَذَا عدله
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And this #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] His justice.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ووفّق من شَاءَ بمزيد عناية وَأَرَادَ من نَفسه أَن يُعينهُ ويوفّقه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And He granted success to whom He willed with extra care, and He willed from Himself to help him and guide him to success —
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَهَذَا فَضله
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  so this #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] His grace.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وخذل من لَيْسَ بِأَهْل لتوفيقه وفضله وخلى بَينه وَبَين نَفسه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And He abandoned the one who #text(fill: luma(120))[\[was\]] not worthy of His guidance and His grace, and left him to himself,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَلم يرد سُبْحَانَهُ من نَفسه أَن يوفّقه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and He did not will, glorified #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] He, from Himself to grant him success.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَقطع عَنهُ فَضله وَلم يحرمه عدله
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So He cut off from him His grace, but did not deprive him of His justice.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَهَذَا نَوْعَانِ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And this #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is of\]] two types.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
