  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and preferring His enemy in obedience and agreement over Him,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وتناسي ذكره وشكره
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and forgetting His remembrance and gratitude #text(fill: luma(120))[\[to Him\]].
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَهُوَ أهل أَن يَخْذُلهُ ويتخلى عَنهُ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So he #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] deserving of #text(fill: luma(120))[\[God\]] abandoning him and leaving him.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَالثَّانِي أَن لَا يَشَاء لَهُ ذَلِك ابْتِدَاء
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And the second #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] that He does not will that for him from the start,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
