  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  #text(fill: luma(120))[\[God\]] Most High said:
]

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿﴿وَكَذَلِكَ فَتَنَّا بَعْضَهُمْ بِبَعْضٍ لِيَقُولُوا أَهَؤُلاءِ مَنَّ اللَّهُ عَلَيْهِمْ مِنْ بَيْنِنَا أَلَيْسَ اللَّهُ بِأَعْلَم بِالشَّاكِرِينَ﴾﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  "And likewise We tested some of them by others, so that they would say: '#text(fill: luma(120))[\[Are\]] these the ones God has favored from among us?' #text(fill: luma(120))[\[Is\]] God not most knowing of the grateful?"
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [6:53] — Sahih Intl: And thus We have tried some of them through others that the disbelievers might say, "Is it these whom Allah has favored among us?" Is not Allah most knowing of those who are grateful?
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَقَالَ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And He said:
]

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿﴿وَلَوْ عَلِمَ اللَّهُ فِيهِمْ خَيْرًا لأسمعهم﴾﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  "And if God had known any good in them, He would have made them hear."
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [8:23] — Sahih Intl: Had Allah known any good in them, He would have made them hear. And if He had made them hear, they would [still] have turned away, while they were refusing.
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَإِذا قضى على هَذِه النُّفُوس بالضلال وَالْمَعْصِيَة كَانَ ذَلِك مَحْض الْعدْل
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So when He decrees upon these souls misguidance and disobedience, that #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] pure justice,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  كَمَا إِذا قضى على الحيّة بِأَن تقتل وعَلى الْعَقْرَب وعَلى الْكَلْب الْعَقُور
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  just as when He decrees that the snake #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] to be killed, and the scorpion, and the biting dog —
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  كَانَ ذَلِك عدلا فِيهِ وَإِن كَانَ مخلوقا على هَذِه الصّفة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  that #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] justice regarding it, even if it was created upon this nature.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَقد اسْتَوْفَيْنَا الْكَلَام فِي هَذَا فِي كتَابنَا الْكَبِير فِي الْقَضَاء وَالْقدر
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And we have covered the discussion on this fully in our large book on decree and destiny.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَالْمَقْصُود أَن قَوْله مَاض فِي حكمك عدل فِي قضاؤك
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And the point #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] that his saying "Your ruling #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] carried out, Your decree #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] just"
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  رد على الطَّائِفَتَيْنِ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] a response to the two groups:
]

