  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  But the Lord, Most High — when you fear Him, you find comfort in Him and draw near to Him.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  لَو نفع الْعلم بِلَا عمل لما ذمّ الله سُبْحَانَهُ أَحْبَار أهل الْكتاب
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  If knowledge without action were beneficial, God — glorified #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] He — would not have blamed the scholars of the People of the Book.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
