  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And if you do not resist it, it becomes an action.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَإِن لم تتداركه بضدّه صَار عَادَة فيصعب عَلَيْك الِانْتِقَال عَنْهَا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And if you do not counter it with its opposite, it becomes #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] habit, and #text(fill: luma(120))[\[it\]] becomes hard for you to move away from it.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
