  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And His mercy #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] its filling.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  الرَّابِع مشْهد الْحِكْمَة وَأَن حكمته سُبْحَانَهُ اقْتَضَت ذَلِك
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  The fourth: the perspective of wisdom — that His wisdom, glorified #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] He, required that.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  لم يقدّره سدى وَلَا قَضَاهُ عَبَثا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  He did not decree it without purpose, nor did He ordain it in vain.
