  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  You will see when the dust clears — #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is it\]] a horse beneath you, or #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] donkey?
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فِي الطَّبْع شَره وَالْحمية أوفق
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  In #text(fill: luma(120))[\[human\]] nature #text(fill: luma(120))[\[there is\]] greed, and restraint #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] more fitting.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  لص الْحِرْص لَا يمشي إِلَّا فِي ظلام الْهوى
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  The thief of greed does not walk except in the darkness of desire.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  حَبَّة المشتهى تَحت فخ التّلف
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  The grain of craving #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] beneath the trap of ruin.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فتفكر الذّبْح وَقد هان الصَّبْر
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So reflect on the slaughter, and patience #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] become easy.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  قُوَّة الطمع فِي بُلُوغ الأمل توجب الِاجْتِهَاد فِي الطّلب
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  The strength of eagerness to reach #text(fill: luma(120))[\[one's\]] hope requires striving in the pursuit,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَشدَّة الحذر من فَوت المأمول
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and extreme caution against missing what #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] hoped for.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
