  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  When you kindle the fire of revenge from the fire of anger, it begins by burning the one who kindled #text(fill: luma(120))[\[it\]] — most surely.
]
