  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  your anger with the chain of forbearance, for it #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is a\]] dog — if it breaks loose, it destroys.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  من سبقت لَهُ سَابِقَة السَّعَادَة دلّ على الدَّلِيل قبل الطّلب
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Whoever #text(fill: luma(120))[\[there\]] preceded for him a prior #text(fill: luma(120))[\[decree\]] of happiness, #text(fill: luma(120))[\[he\]] was shown the guide before #text(fill: luma(120))[\[the\]] seeking.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  إِذا أَرَادَ الْقدر شخصا بذر فِي أَرض قلبه بذر التَّوْفِيق
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  When destiny intends #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] person, it sows in the soil of his heart the seed of divine help.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ثمَّ سقَاهُ بِمَاء الرَّغْبَة والرهبة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Then it waters it with the water of hope and fear.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ثمَّ أَقَامَ عَلَيْهِ بأطوار المراقبة واستخدم لَهُ حارس الْعلم
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Then it sets over it the stages of watchfulness, and employs for it the guard of knowledge.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَإِذا الزَّرْع قَائِم على سوقه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And then the crop #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] standing on its stems.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  إِذا طلع نجم الهمة فِي ظلام ليل البطالة وَردفهُ قمر الْعَزِيمَة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  When the star of ambition rises in the darkness of the night of idleness, and the moon of determination follows it,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
