  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  the earth of the heart shines with the light of its Lord.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  إِذا جن اللَّيْل تغالب النّوم والسهر
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  When the night falls, sleep and wakefulness struggle against each other.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فالخوف والشوق فِي مقدم عَسْكَر الْيَقَظَة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Fear and longing #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] at the front of the army of wakefulness.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  والكسل والتواني فِي كَتِيبَة الْغَفْلَة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And laziness and sluggishness #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] in the battalion of heedlessness.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَإِذا حمل الْعَزْم حمل على الميمنة وانهزمت جنود التَّفْرِيط
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So when resolve charges, it charges on the right flank, and the soldiers of neglect #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] defeated.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَمَا يطلع الْفجْر إِلَّا وَقد قسمت السهْمَان وَبَردت الْغَنِيمَة لأَهْلهَا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And the dawn does not rise except that the shares have #text(fill: luma(120))[\[already\]] been divided and the spoils have been settled for their people.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  سفر اللَّيْل لَا يطيقه إِلَّا مُضْمر المجاعة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Night travel — none can endure it except one made lean by hunger.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  النجائب فِي الأول وحاملات الزَّاد فِي الْأَخير
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  The fine camels #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] at the front, and the provision-carriers #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] at the rear.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  لَا تسأم من الْوُقُوف على الْبَاب وَلَو طردت
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Do not grow weary of standing at the door, even if you #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] turned away.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَلَا تقطع الِاعْتِذَار وَلَو رددت
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And do not stop apologizing, even if you #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] rejected.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَإِن فتح الْبَاب للمقبولين دُونك فاهجم هجوم الْكَذَّابين
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  If the door #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] opened for the accepted ones without you, then rush in #text(fill: luma(120))[\[like\]] the rushing of the bold claimants.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
