  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And God, glorified #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] He, by His wisdom made the good things for the good #text(fill: luma(120))[\[people\]] and the good #text(fill: luma(120))[\[people\]] for the good things — and the opposite of that.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  لَيْسَ فِي الْوُجُود الْمُمكن سَبَب وَاحِد مُسْتَقل بالتأثير
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  There #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] not in #text(fill: luma(120))[\[the\]] possible existence #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] single cause independent in #text(fill: luma(120))[\[its\]] effect.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  بل لَا يُؤثر سَبَب الْبَتَّةَ إِلَّا بانضمام سَبَب آخر إِلَيْهِ وَانْتِفَاء مَانع يمْنَع تَأْثِيره
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Rather, no cause produces #text(fill: luma(120))[\[an\]] effect at all except by #text(fill: luma(120))[\[the\]] joining of another cause to it and #text(fill: luma(120))[\[the\]] removal of #text(fill: luma(120))[\[an\]] obstacle that prevents its effect.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  هَذَا فِي الْأَسْبَاب المشهودة بالعيان وَفِي الْأَسْبَاب الغائبة والأسباب المعنوية
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  This #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is so\]] for the causes witnessed by sight, and for the unseen causes and the abstract causes.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  كتأثير الشَّمْس فِي الْحَيَوَان والنبات
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Like the effect of the sun on animals and plants,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَإِنَّهُ مَوْقُوف على أَسبَاب أخر من وجود مَحل قَابل
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  for it #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] dependent on other causes, #text(fill: luma(120))[\[such as\]] the existence of #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] receiving place,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَأَسْبَاب أخر تنضم إِلَى ذَلِك السَّبَب
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and other causes that join to that cause.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَكَذَلِكَ حُصُول الْوَلَد مَوْقُوف على عدَّة أَسبَاب غير وَطْء الْفَحْل
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And likewise, the production of offspring #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] dependent on several causes other than the mating of the male.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَكَذَلِكَ جَمِيع الْأَسْبَاب مَعَ مسبباتها
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And likewise #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] all causes with their effects.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَكل مَا يخَاف ويرجى من الْمَخْلُوقَات فأعلى غاياته أَن يكون جُزْء سَبَب غير مُسْتَقل بالتأثير
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So everything that #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] feared and hoped for from created things — the highest of its limits #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] that it #text(fill: luma(120))[\[would\]] be #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] part of #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] cause, not independent in #text(fill: luma(120))[\[its\]] effect.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
