#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  طَالب الله وَالدَّار الْآخِرَة لَا يَسْتَقِيم لَهُ سيره وَطَلَبه إِلَّا بحبسين
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  The seeker of God and the Abode of the Hereafter — his path and seeking #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] not #text(fill: luma(120))[\[be\]] straight for him except with two confinements:
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  حبس قلبه فِي طلبه ومطلوبه وحبسه عَن الِالْتِفَات إِلَى غَيره
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  confining his heart in his pursuit and what he seeks, and confining it from turning to other than Him,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَحبس لِسَانه عَمَّا لَا يُفِيد وحبسه على ذكر الله وَمَا يزِيد فِي إيمَانه ومعرفته
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and confining his tongue from what does not benefit, and confining it to the remembrance of God and what increases his faith and knowledge,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَحبس جوارحه عَن الْمعاصِي والشهوات وحبسها على الْوَاجِبَات والمندوبات
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and confining his limbs from sins and desires, and confining them to the obligations and recommended acts.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَلَا يُفَارق الْحَبْس حَتَّى يلقى ربه فيخلصه من السجْن إِلَى أوسع فضاء وأطيبه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So he does not leave confinement until he meets his Lord, and He frees him from the prison to the widest and most pleasant open space.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَمَتى لم يصبر على هذَيْن الحبسين وفر مِنْهُمَا إِلَى فضاء الشَّهَوَات أعقبه ذَلِك الْحَبْس الفظيع عِنْد خُرُوجه من الدُّنْيَا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And whenever he does not have patience with these two confinements and flees from them to the open space of desires, that #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] lead him to the terrible confinement upon his departure from this world.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَكل خَارج من الدُّنْيَا إِمَّا متخلص من الْحَبْس وَإِمَّا ذَاهِب إِلَى الْحَبْس
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So everyone departing from this world #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] either freed from confinement, or going to confinement.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
