  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and justice in anger and contentment, and moderation in poverty and wealth.'
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَفِي الزّهْد للْإِمَام أَحْمد أثر إلهي
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And in al-Zuhd by Imam Ahmad, #text(fill: luma(120))[\[there is\]] a divine report:
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  مَا من مَخْلُوق اعْتصمَ بمخلوق دوني إِلَّا قطعت أَسبَاب السَّمَوَات وَالْأَرْض دونه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  'There #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] no creature #text(fill: luma(120))[\[who\]] seeks refuge in #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] creature besides Me, except #text(fill: luma(120))[\[that\]] I cut the means of the heavens and the earth from him.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَإِن سَأَلَني لم أعْطه وَإِن دَعَاني لم أجبه وَإِن استغفرني لم أَغفر لَهُ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So if he asks Me, I #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] not give him, and if he calls upon Me, I #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] not answer him, and if he seeks My forgiveness, I #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] not forgive him.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَمَا من مَخْلُوق اعْتصمَ بِي دون خلقي إِلَّا ضمنت السَّمَوَات وَالْأَرْض رزقه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And there #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] no creature #text(fill: luma(120))[\[who\]] seeks refuge in Me instead of My creation, except #text(fill: luma(120))[\[that\]] I guarantee the heavens and the earth his sustenance.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَإِن سَأَلَني أَعْطيته وَإِن دَعَاني أَجَبْته وَإِن استغفرني غفرت لَهُ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So if he asks Me, I #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] give him, and if he calls upon Me, I #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] answer him, and if he seeks My forgiveness, I #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] forgive him.'
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  يصلح مَا بَين العَبْد وَبَين ربه وَحسن الْخلق يصلح مَا بَينه وَبَين خلقه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  #text(fill: luma(120))[\[it\]] fixes what #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] between the servant and his Lord, and good character fixes what #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] between him and His creation.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فتقوى الله توجب لَهُ محبَّة الله وَحسن الْخلق يَدْعُو إِلَى محبته
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So God-consciousness earns him the love of God, and good character calls #text(fill: luma(120))[\[people\]] to love him.
]
#align(right)[#text(7pt, fill: luma(170))[p. 54]]

