  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and his soul #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] in His hand, and his heart #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] between two fingers of His fingers — He turns it however He wills.
