  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Rather, he #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] in desperate need of Him with every breath, in every particle of his being, inwardly and outwardly.
