  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So as long as the lifespan remains, provision #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will be\]] coming.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَإِذا سد عَلَيْك بِحِكْمَتِهِ طَرِيقا من طرقه فتح لَك برحمته طَرِيقا أَنْفَع لَك مِنْهُ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And if He closes off for you by His wisdom #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] path from His paths, He opens for you by His mercy #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] path more beneficial for you than it.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فتأمّل حَال الْجَنِين يَأْتِيهِ غذاؤه وَهُوَ الدَّم من طَرِيق وَاحِدَة وَهُوَ السُّرَّة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So reflect on the state of the fetus — its nourishment comes to it, which #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] the blood, through one single path, which #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] the umbilical cord.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَلَمَّا خرج من بطن الْأُم وانقطعت تِلْكَ الطَّرِيق فتح لَهُ طَرِيقين اثْنَيْنِ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Then when it came out from the mother's womb and that path was cut off, He opened for it two paths.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وأجرى لَهُ فيهمَا رزقا أطيب وألذ من الأول لَبَنًا خَالِصا سائغا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And He made flow for it through them #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] provision purer and sweeter than the first — milk, pure #text(fill: luma(120))[\[and\]] easy #text(fill: luma(120))[\[to swallow\]].
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَإِذا تمت مُدَّة الرَّضَاع وانقطعت الطريقان بالفطام فتح طرقًا أَرْبَعَة أكمل مِنْهَا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Then when the period of nursing was complete and the two paths were cut off by weaning, He opened four paths more complete than them.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
