  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Two foods and two drinks. The two foods #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] from animals and plants, and the two drinks #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] from water and milk, and what #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] added to them of benefits and pleasures.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَإِذا مَاتَ انْقَطَعت عَنهُ هَذِه الطّرق الْأَرْبَعَة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Then when he dies, these four paths #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] cut off from him.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  لكنه سُبْحَانَهُ فتح لَهُ إِن كَانَ سعيدا طرقا ثَمَانِيَة وَهِي أَبْوَاب الْجنَّة الثَّمَانِية يدْخل من أَيهَا شَاءَ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  But He, glorified #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] He, opens for him — if he was blessed — eight paths, which #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] the eight gates of Paradise, entering from whichever of them he wishes.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَهَكَذَا الرب سُبْحَانَهُ لَا يمْنَع عَبده الْمُؤمن شَيْئا من الدُّنْيَا إِلَّا ويؤتيه أفضل مِنْهُ وأنفع لَهُ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So likewise, the Lord, glorified #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] He, does not prevent His believing servant #text(fill: luma(120))[\[from a\]] thing of this world except that He gives him #text(fill: luma(120))[\[something\]] better than it and more beneficial for him.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَلَيْسَ ذَلِك لغير الْمُؤمن
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And that #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] not #text(fill: luma(120))[\[the case\]] for the non-believer.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَإِنَّهُ يمنعهُ الْحَظ الْأَدْنَى الخسيس وَلَا يرضى لَهُ بِهِ ليعطيه الْحَظ الْأَعْلَى النفيس
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  For He prevents him from the lower, worthless share and #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] not pleased for him with it, in order to give him the higher, precious share.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَالْعَبْد لجهله بمصالح نَفسه وجهله بكرم ربه وحكمته ولطفه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  But the servant, due to his ignorance of what #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] good for himself, and his ignorance of the generosity of his Lord, His wisdom, and His kindness —
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  لَا يعرف التَّفَاوُت بَين مَا منع مِنْهُ وَبَين مَا ذخر لَهُ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  he does not know the difference between what he was prevented from and what was stored up for him.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  بل هُوَ مولع بحب العاجل وَإِن كَانَ دنيئا وبقلة الرَّغْبَة فِي الآجل وَإِن كَانَ عليا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Rather, he #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] attached to love of the immediate, even if it #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] lowly, and #text(fill: luma(120))[\[has\]] little desire for the deferred, even if it #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] lofty.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَلَو أنصف العَبْد ربه وأنى لَهُ بذلك
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And if the servant were fair to his Lord — and how #text(fill: luma(120))[\[could\]] that #text(fill: luma(120))[\[be\]] for him! —
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  لعلم أَن فَضله عَلَيْهِ فِيمَا مَنعه من الدُّنْيَا ولذاتها وَنَعِيمهَا أعظم من فَضله عَلَيْهِ فِيمَا آتَاهُ من ذَلِك
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  he would know that His favor upon him in what He prevented him from of this world and its pleasures and its comforts #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] greater than His favor upon him in what He gave him of that.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَمَا مَنعه إِلَّا ليعطيه وَلَا ابتلاه إِلَّا ليعافيه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So He did not prevent him except to give him, and He did not test him except to heal him.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَلَا امتحنه إِلَّا ليصافيه وَلَا أَمَاتَهُ إِلَّا ليحييه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And He did not try him except to purify him, and He did not cause him to die except to give him life.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَلَا أخرجه إِلَى هَذِه الدَّار إِلَّا ليتأهب مِنْهَا للقدوم عَلَيْهِ وليسلك الطَّرِيق الموصلة إِلَيْهِ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And He did not bring him out to this abode except to prepare from it for the arrival to Him, and to travel the path that leads to Him.
]

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿فَجعل اللَّيْلَ وَالنَّهَارَ خِلْفَةً لِمَنْ أَرَادَ أَنْ يَذَّكَّرَ أَوْ أَرَادَ شكُورًا﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  So He made the night and the day #text(fill: luma(120))[\[in\]] succession, for whoever wanted to remember or wanted #text(fill: luma(120))[\[to show\]] gratitude.
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [25:62] — Sahih Intl: And it is He who has made the night and the day in succession for whoever desires to remember or desires gratitude.
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وأبى الظَّالِمُونَ إِلَّا كُفُورًا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  But the wrongdoers refused #text(fill: luma(120))[\[everything\]] except ingratitude.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
