  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿﴿إِنَّ اللَّهَ اشْتَرَى مِنَ الْمُؤْمِنِينَ أَنْفُسَهُمْ﴾﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  "Indeed God has purchased from the believers their selves."
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [9:111] — Sahih Intl: Indeed, Allah has purchased from the believers their lives and their properties [in exchange] for that they will have Paradise. They fight in the cause of Allah, so they kill and are killed. [It is] a true promise [binding] upon Him in the Torah and the Gospel and the Qur'an. And who is truer to his covenant than Allah? So rejoice in your transaction which you have contracted. And it is that which is the great attainment.
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَمَا اشْترى إِلَّا سلْعَة هذبها الْإِيمَان
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  He only purchased goods that faith had refined,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَخرجت من طبعها إِلَى بلد سكانه التائبون العابدون
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  so they came out from their #text(fill: luma(120))[\[raw\]] nature to #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] land whose inhabitants #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] the repentant, the worshippers.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  سلم الْمَبِيع قبل أَن يتْلف فِي يدك فَلَا يقبله المُشْتَرِي
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Hand over what #text(fill: luma(120))[\[was\]] sold before it perishes in your hand, for #text(fill: luma(120))[\[then\]] the Buyer #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] not accept it.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  قد علم المُشْتَرِي بِعَيْب السّلْعَة قبل أَن يَشْتَرِيهَا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  The Buyer already knew of the defect of the goods before He purchased them,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فسلمها وَلَك الْأمان من الرَّد
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  so hand them over, and you #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] have safety from return.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  قدر السّلْعَة يعرف بِقدر مشتريها وَالثمن المبذول فِيهِ والمنادي عَلَيْهَا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  The value of the goods #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] known by the worth of their buyer, and the price paid for them, and the one calling out over them.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَإِذا كَانَ الْمُشْتَرى عَظِيما وَالثمن خطيرا والمنادي جَلِيلًا كَانَت السّلْعَة نفيسة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So if the buyer #text(fill: luma(120))[\[was\]] great, and the price #text(fill: luma(120))[\[was\]] immense, and the caller #text(fill: luma(120))[\[was\]] majestic, then the goods #text(fill: luma(120))[\[were\]] precious.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  يَا بَائِعا نَفسه بيع الهوان
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  O seller of his self #text(fill: luma(120))[\[for\]] the sale of humiliation —
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  لَو استرجعت ذَا البيع قبل الْفَوْت لم تخب
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  if you took back this sale before #text(fill: luma(120))[\[it is\]] too late, you would not lose.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وبائعا طيب عَيْش مَا لَهُ خطر
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And #text(fill: luma(120))[\[O\]] seller of #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] good life whose worth has no equal —
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  بطيف عَيْش من الآلام منتهب
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  for #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] phantom of #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] life, seized by pains.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  غبنت وَالله غبنا فَاحِشا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  You were cheated, by God, #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] terrible cheating —
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ولدى يَوْم التغابن تلقى غَايَة الْحَرْب
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and on the Day of Mutual Loss you #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] meet the peak of struggle.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وواردا صفو عَيْش كُله كدر
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And #text(fill: luma(120))[\[O\]] one approaching the clearness of #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] life #text(fill: luma(120))[\[that is\]] all murky —
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  أمامك الْورْد حَقًا لَيْسَ بِالْكَذِبِ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  before you #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] the arrival truly, not #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] lie.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وحاطب اللَّيْل فِي الظلماء منتصبا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And #text(fill: luma(120))[\[O\]] gatherer of firewood at night, standing in the darkness —
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  لكل داهية تدني من العطب
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  for every disaster that brings #text(fill: luma(120))[\[you\]] near to ruin.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ترجوا الشِّفَاء بأحداق بهَا مرض
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  You hope for healing through eyes that have sickness —
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَهَل سَمِعت ببرء جَاءَ من عطب
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  have you #text(fill: luma(120))[\[ever\]] heard of #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] cure that came from ruin?
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ومفنيا نَفسه فِي أثر أقبحهم
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And #text(fill: luma(120))[\[O\]] one wasting his self in pursuit of the ugliest of them —
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وصفه اللطخ جمال فِيهِ مستلب
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  whose quality #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] blemish, beauty in him #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] stolen away.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وواهبا نَفسه من مثل ذَا سفها
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And #text(fill: luma(120))[\[O\]] one giving his self to the likes of this #text(fill: luma(120))[\[out of\]] foolishness —
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  لَو كنت تعرف قدر النَّفس لم تهب
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  if you knew the worth of the self, you would not give #text(fill: luma(120))[\[it away\]].
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  شَاب الصِّبَا والتصابي لم يشب
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Youth has grown gray, yet acting youthful has not aged —
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَضاع وقتك بَين اللَّهْو واللعب
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and your time #text(fill: luma(120))[\[was\]] wasted between amusement and play.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وشمس عمرك قد حَان الْغُرُوب لَهَا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And the sun of your life — its setting has come due —
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  والفيء فِي الْأُفق الشَّرْقِي لم يغب
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  yet the shadow on the eastern horizon has not faded.
]
