#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وفاز بالوصل من قد جدوا انقشعت ... عَن أفقه ظلمات اللَّيْل والسحب
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And #text(fill: luma(120))[\[those\]] who strived won the union — #text(fill: luma(120))[\[there\]] cleared away ... from his horizon the darknesses of the night and the clouds
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  كم ذَا التَّخَلُّف وَالدُّنْيَا قد ارتحلت ... ورسل رَبك قد وافتك فِي الطّلب
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  How long #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] this falling behind #text(fill: luma(120))[\[last\]] while this world has departed ... and the messengers of your Lord have come to you in the pursuit?
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  مَا فِي الديار وَقد سَارَتْ ركائب من ... تهواه للصب من شكر وَلَا أرب
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  There #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] nothing in the dwellings — and the caravans of the one ... you love have departed — for the longing one, no gratitude and no desire
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فافرش الخد ذياك التُّرَاب وَقل ... مَا قَالَه صَاحب الأشواق والحقب
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So spread #text(fill: luma(120))[\[your\]] cheek on that dust, and say ... what the companion of longings and ages said:
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  مَا ربع مية محفوفا يطِيف بِهِ ... غيلَان أشهى لَهُ من ربعك الخرب
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  The abode of Mayya, surrounded, with Ghaylan circling it ... #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] not more desirable to him than your ruined abode
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  منازلا كَانَ يهواها ويألفها ... أَيَّام كَانَ منال الْوَصْل عَن كثب
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Dwellings he used to love and feel at home in ... #text(fill: luma(120))[\[in\]] the days when attaining union #text(fill: luma(120))[\[was\]] within reach
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَلَا الخدود وَلَو أدمين من ضرج ... أشهى إِلَى ناظري من ربعك الخرب
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Nor #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] the cheeks, even if reddened with blush ... more desirable to my eyes than your ruined abode
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَكلما جليت تِلْكَ الربوع لَهُ ... يهوى إِلَيْهَا هوى المَاء فِي الصبب
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And whenever those grounds #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] revealed to him ... he falls toward them #text(fill: luma(120))[\[like\]] the falling of water on #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] slope
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  أحيي لَهُ الشوق تذكار العهود بهَا ... فَلَو دعِي الْقلب للسلوان لم يجب
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  The remembrance of the times there revived longing in him ... and if the heart #text(fill: luma(120))[\[were\]] called to consolation, it would not answer
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  هَذَا وَكم منزل فِي الأَرْض يألفه ... وَمَاله فِي سواهَا الدَّهْر من رغب
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  This — and how many #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] dwelling in the earth he feels at home in ... while he has no desire ever in anything other than it
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  مَا فِي الْخيام أَخُو وجدير يحك إِن ... بثثته بعض شَأْن الْحبّ فاغترب
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  There #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] not in the tents #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] brother of deep feeling who #text(fill: luma(120))[\[would be\]] moved if ... you confided to him some of the affair of love — so go far away
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَأسر فِي غَمَرَات اللَّيْل متهديا ... بنفحة الطّيب لَا بِالْعودِ والحطب
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And travel in the depths of the night, guided ... by the breeze of fragrance, not by the #text(fill: luma(120))[\[fire\]]wood and firewood
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَعَاد كل أخي جبن ومعجزة ... وَحَارب النَّفس لَا تلقيك فِي الْحَرْب
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And oppose every brother of cowardice and weakness ... and fight the self — do not let it meet you in battle
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَخذ لنَفسك نورا تستضيء بِهِ ... يَوْم اقتسام الورى الْأَنْوَار بالرتب
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And take for yourself #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] light to illuminate #text(fill: luma(120))[\[your way\]] by ... #text(fill: luma(120))[\[on\]] the day people divide the lights by ranks
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  إِن كَانَ يُوجب صبري رَحْمَتي فرضا ... بِسوء حَالي وَحل للضنا بدني
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  If my patience necessitates Your mercy — then #text(fill: luma(120))[\[I am\]] content ... with the bad state of my condition, and illness has settled in my body
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  منحتك الرّوح لَا أبغي لَهَا ثمنا ... إِلَّا رضاك ووافقري الا الثّمن
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  I granted You the soul, not seeking for it #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] price ... except Your pleasure — and how generous #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] that price!
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  أحن بأطراف النَّهَار صبَابَة ... وبالليل يدعوني الْهوى فَأُجِيب
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  I yearn at the edges of the day #text(fill: luma(120))[\[out of\]] longing ... and at night, love calls me and I answer
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَإِذا لم يكن من الْعِشْق بُد ... فَمن عجز عشق غير الْجَمِيل
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And if there #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] no escape from passionate love ... then #text(fill: luma(120))[\[it is\]] from weakness to love other than the Beautiful
]
