#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَلَو أَن مَا أسعى لعيش معجل ... كفاني مِنْهُ بعض مَا أَنا فِيهِ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  If what I strive for #text(fill: luma(120))[\[were\]] #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] hastened life... some of what I #text(fill: luma(120))[\[am already\]] in would have sufficed me of it
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ولكنما أسمى لملك مخلد ... فوا أسفا إِن لم أكن بملاقيه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  But rather I aspire to #text(fill: luma(120))[\[an\]] eternal kingdom... so what grief if I #text(fill: luma(120))[\[am\]] not to meet it!
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  يَا من هُوَ من أَرْبَاب الْخِبْرَة هَل عرفت قيمَة نَفسك
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  O you who #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] among the people of experience — have you known the value of yourself?
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  إِنَّمَا خلقت الأكوان كلهَا لَك
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  The worlds were all only created for you.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  يَا من غذى بلبان الْبر وقلب بأيدي الألطاف
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  O you who #text(fill: luma(120))[\[was\]] nourished with the milk of goodness and turned over by the hands of #text(fill: luma(120))[\[divine\]] kindness!
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  كل الْأَشْيَاء شَجَرَة وَأَنت الثَّمَرَة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Everything #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is a\]] tree, and you #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] the fruit.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَصُورَة وَأَنت الْمَعْنى
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] form, and you #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] the meaning.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وصدف وَأَنت الدّرّ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] shell, and you #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] the pearl.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ومخيض وَأَنت الزّبد
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] churn, and you #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] the butter.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  منشور اختيارنا لَك وَاضح الْخط وَلَكِن استخراجك ضَعِيف
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  The decree of Our choosing you #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] clear #text(fill: luma(120))[\[in its\]] writing, but your drawing #text(fill: luma(120))[\[it\]] out #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] weak.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  مَتى رمت طلبي فاطلبني عنْدك
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Whenever you seek to find Me, then seek Me within yourself.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  اطلبني مِنْك تجدني قَرِيبا وَلَا تطلبني من غَيْرك فَأَنا أقرب إِلَيْك مِنْهُ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Seek Me from yourself #text(fill: luma(120))[\[and\]] you #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] find Me near, and do not seek Me from other than yourself, for I #text(fill: luma(120))[\[am\]] closer to you than he #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]].
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  لَو عرفت قدر نَفسك عندنَا مَا أهنتها بِالْمَعَاصِي
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  If you knew the worth of yourself with Us, you would not have humiliated it with sins.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  إِنَّمَا أبعدنا إِبْلِيس إِذْ لم يسْجد لَك وَأَنت فِي صلب أَبِيك
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  We only cast away Iblis because he did not prostrate to you — while you #text(fill: luma(120))[\[were still\]] in the backbone of your father.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فوا عجبا كَيفَ صالحته وَتَرَكتنَا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So how strange — how #text(fill: luma(120))[\[did\]] you make peace with him and leave Us!
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  لَو كَانَ فِي قَلْبك محبَّة لبان أَثَرهَا على جسدك
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  If there were love in your heart, its effect would have shown on your body.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَلما ادعيت الْحبّ قَالَت كذبتي ... أَلَسْت أرى الْأَعْضَاء مِنْك كواسيا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And when I claimed love, she said: 'You lie! Do I not see your limbs #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] well-clothed?'
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  لَو تغذى الْقلب بالمحبة لذهبت عَنهُ بطنة الشَّهَوَات
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  If the heart were nourished with love, the bloating of desires would have left it.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَلَو كنت عُذْري الصبابة لم تكن ... بطينا وأنساك الْهوى كَثْرَة الْأكل
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And if you were pure in longing, you would not have been stuffed — and excessive eating #text(fill: luma(120))[\[has\]] made you forget desire.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  لَو صحّت محبتك لاستوحشت مِمَّن لَا يذكرك بالحبيب
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  If your love were true, you would feel uneasy with whoever does not remind you of the Beloved.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَاعجَبا لمن يَدعِي الْمحبَّة وَيحْتَاج إِلَى من يذكرهُ بمحبوبه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And how strange #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] the one who claims love yet needs someone to remind him of his beloved!
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَلَا يذكرهُ إِلَّا بمذكر
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So he does not remember Him except with #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] reminder.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  أقل مَا فِي الْمحبَّة أَنَّهَا لَا تنسيك تذكر المحبوب
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  The least #text(fill: luma(120))[\[thing\]] in love #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] that it does not make you forget to remember the beloved.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ذكرتك لَا أَنِّي نستك سَاعَة ... وأيسر مَا فِي الذّكر ذكر لساني
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  I mentioned you — not that I forgot you #text(fill: luma(120))[\[for a\]] moment... and the easiest #text(fill: luma(120))[\[thing\]] in remembrance #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] the mention of my tongue.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  إِذا سَافر الْمُحب للقاء محبوبه ركبت جُنُوده مَعَه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  When the lover travels to meet his beloved, his soldiers ride with him.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَكَانَ الْحبّ فِي مُقَدّمَة الْعَسْكَر
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And love #text(fill: luma(120))[\[was\]] at the front of the army,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  والرجاء يَحْدُو بالمطى والشوق يَسُوقهَا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and hope #text(fill: luma(120))[\[was\]] driving the camels, and longing #text(fill: luma(120))[\[was\]] pushing them forward,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَالْخَوْف يجمعها على الطَّرِيق
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and fear #text(fill: luma(120))[\[was\]] keeping them together on the road.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَإِذا شَارف قدوم بلد الْوَصْل خرجت تقادم الحبيب باللقاء
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And when he neared arrival at the land of union, the gifts of the Beloved came out with the meeting.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فداو سقما بجسم أَنْت متلفه ... وأبرد غراما بقلب أَنْت مضرمه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So heal #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] sickness in #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] body that You #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] destroying... and cool #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] passion in #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] heart that You #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] setting ablaze.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَلَا تَكِلنِي على بعد الديار إِلَى ... صبري الضَّعِيف فصبري أَنْت تعلمه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And do not leave me, with the distance of homes, to... my weak patience, for my patience — You know it.
]
#align(right)[#text(7pt, fill: luma(170))[p. 77]]

// --- Page 75 (vol. page 78) ---


#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  تلقى قلبه فقد أَرْسلتهُ عجلا ... إِلَى لقائك والأشواق تقدمه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Receive his heart, for I have sent it in haste... to meet you, and the longings go before it.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَإِذا دخل على الحبيب أفيضت عَلَيْهِ الْخلْع من كل نَاحيَة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So when he entered upon the Beloved, robes of honor #text(fill: luma(120))[\[were\]] poured upon him from every side,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ليمتحن أيسكن إِلَيْهَا فَتكون حَظه أم يكون التفاته إِلَى من ألبسهُ إِيَّاهَا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  to test #text(fill: luma(120))[\[him\]] — would he settle with them so they become his portion, or would his attention #text(fill: luma(120))[\[be\]] toward the One who clothed him in them?
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ملأوا مراكب الْقُلُوب مَتَاعا لَا تنْفق إِلَّا على الْملك
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  They filled the ships of the hearts #text(fill: luma(120))[\[with\]] goods that #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] only spent on the King.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَلَمَّا هبت ريَاح السحر أقلعت تِلْكَ المراكب
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So when the winds of the pre-dawn blew, those ships set sail.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَمَا طلع الْفجْر الا وَهِي بالمينا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And dawn did not rise except #text(fill: luma(120))[\[that\]] they #text(fill: luma(120))[\[were already\]] at the harbor.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  قطعُوا بادية الْهوى بأقدام الْجد
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  They crossed the desert of desire with the feet of seriousness.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَمَا كَانَ إِلَّا الْقَلِيل حَتَّى قدمُوا من السّفر
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And it was only #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] little #text(fill: luma(120))[\[while\]] until they arrived from the journey.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فأعقبهم الرَّاحَة فِي طَرِيق التلقي
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And #text(fill: luma(120))[\[it\]] brought them rest on the path of meeting.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَدَخَلُوا بلد الْوَصْل وَقد حَاز ربح الْأَبَد
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So they entered the land of union, having gained the profit of eternity.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فرّغ الْقَوْم قُلُوبهم من الشواغل
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  The people emptied their hearts of distractions,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَضربت فِيهَا سرادقات الْمحبَّة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  so the pavilions of love #text(fill: luma(120))[\[were\]] pitched in them.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فأقاموا الْعُيُون تحرس تَارَة وترش أُخْرَى
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And they set up the eyes — guarding at times and sprinkling #text(fill: luma(120))[\[tears\]] at others.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  سرادق الْمحبَّة لَا يضْرب إِلَّا فِي قاع نزه فارغ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  The pavilion of love #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] not pitched except in #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] clean, empty ground.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
