  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [12:24] — Sahih Intl: And she certainly determined [to seduce] him, and he would have inclined to her had he not seen the proof of his Lord. And thus [it was] that We should avert from him evil and immorality. Indeed, he was of Our chosen servants.
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
