  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And what #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] with God #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] better and more lasting, for those who believed and upon their Lord #text(fill: luma(120))[\[they\]] rely.
