]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَأما الْفَضَائِل الْمُنْفَصِلَة عَنْهَا كالملابس والمراكب والمساكن والجاه وَالْمَال
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  As for the external virtues separate from it — like clothing, vehicles, homes, status, and wealth —
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَتلك فِي الْحَقِيقَة عوار أعيرتها مُدَّة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  those #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] in reality borrowed things lent to it for #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] time,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ثمَّ يرجع فِيهَا الْمُعير
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
