]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَأكْثر هَذَا الْخلق إِنَّمَا يسعون فِي حرمَان نُفُوسهم وألمها وحسرتها ونقصها
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  For most of these people only strive for the deprivation of their selves, and their pain, and their regret, and their deficiency,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
