  For reliance #text(fill: luma(120))[\[on God\]] #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] among the strongest means in attaining what #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] desired and repelling what #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] disliked.
