  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And if the means #text(fill: luma(120))[\[was\]] permissible, you look: does your taking it weaken #text(fill: luma(120))[\[your\]] reliance #text(fill: luma(120))[\[on God\]] or not weaken it?
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
