]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فتفيده هَذِه الْحَيَاة قُوَّة التميز بَين النافع والضار فِي الْعُلُوم والإرادات والأعمال
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So this life gives him the strength of distinguishing between what #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] beneficial and what #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] harmful in knowledge, intentions, and actions.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وتفيده قُوَّة الْإِيمَان والإرادة وَالْحب للحق وَقُوَّة البغض وَالْكَرَاهَة للباطل
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And it gives him strength of faith, will, and love for the truth, and strength of hatred and dislike for falsehood.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
