  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And even if it had some type of distinguishing, it would not have the strength by which it prefers what #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] beneficial over what #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] harmful.
