  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Just as the human has no life until the angel — who #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] the messenger of God — breathes into him from his spirit,
