#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿وَكَذَلِكَ أَوْحَيْنَا إِلَيْكَ رُوحًا مِنْ أَمْرِنَا مَا كُنْتَ تَدْرِي مَا الْكِتَابُ وَلَا الايمان وَلَكِنْ جَعَلْنَاهُ نُورًا نَهْدِي بِهِ مَنْ نَشَاءُ مِنْ عِبَادِنَا﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  And likewise We revealed to you #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] spirit from Our command. You did not know what the Book #text(fill: luma(120))[\[was\]] nor faith, but We made it #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] light by which We guide whoever We will of Our servants.
  #v(0.06cm)
