  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So his example and their example #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] like #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] people #text(fill: luma(120))[\[upon whom\]] the night darkened, so they went astray and could not find the road.
