  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And another #text(fill: luma(120))[\[person\]] — with him #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is a\]] light he walks with on the road, seeing it and seeing what to beware of on it.
