  when the people of associating partners #text(fill: luma(120))[\[with God\]] and hypocrisy remain in the darknesses of their association and hypocrisy.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَقَوله وَاعْلَمُوا أَنَّ اللَّهَ يحؤل بَيْنَ الْمَرْءِ وَقَلْبِهِ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And His saying: "And know that God comes between #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] person and his heart."
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  الْمَشْهُور فِي الْآيَة أَنه يحول بَين الْمُؤمن وَبَين الْكفْر وَبَين الْكَافِر وَبَين الْإِيمَان
  #v(0.04cm)
