  and if he sees his benefit in withholding #text(fill: luma(120))[\[the\]] giving from him, he does not give him and does not spend freely on him
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  لعلمه أَن ذَلِك أكبر الْأَسْبَاب إِلَى فَسَاده وهلاكه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  because he knows that this #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] the greatest of causes leading to his corruption and destruction
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَكَذَلِكَ يمنعهُ كثيرا من شهواته حمية لَهُ ومصلحة لَا بخلا عَلَيْهِ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and likewise he prevents him from many of his desires — #text(fill: luma(120))[\[as\]] protection for him and #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] benefit, not #text(fill: luma(120))[\[out of\]] stinginess toward him
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فأحكم الْحَاكِمين وأرحم الرَّاحِمِينَ وَأعلم الْعَالمين
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  so the wisest of judges, the most merciful of those who show mercy, and the most knowing of the knowledgeable
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  الَّذِي هُوَ أرْحم بعباده مِنْهُم بِأَنْفسِهِم وَمن آبَائِهِم وأمهاتهم
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  the One who #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] more merciful to His servants than they #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] to themselves, and #text(fill: luma(120))[\[more\]] than their fathers and mothers
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  إِذا أنزل بهم مَا يكْرهُونَ كَانَ خيرا لَهُم من أَن لَا ينزله بهم
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  when He sends down upon them what they dislike, it #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] better for them than #text(fill: luma(120))[\[if\]] He did not send it down upon them
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  نظرا مِنْهُ لَهُم وإحسانا إِلَيْهِم ولطفا بهم
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  #text(fill: luma(120))[\[as\]] care from Him for them, and kindness to them, and gentleness with them
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَلَو مكنوا من الاختيار لأَنْفُسِهِمْ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and if they were given the choice for themselves
]
#align(right)[#text(7pt, fill: luma(170))[p. 92]]

// --- Page 90 (vol. page 93) ---


#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  لعجزوا عَن الْقيام بمصالحهم علما وَإِرَادَة وَعَملا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  they would have been unable to manage their own interests — in knowledge, will, and action.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  لكنه سُبْحَانَهُ تولى تَدْبِير أُمُورهم بِمُوجب علمه وحكمته وَرَحمته
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  But He, glorified #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] He, took charge of managing their affairs according to His knowledge, His wisdom, and His mercy —
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  أَحبُّوا أم كَرهُوا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  whether they liked #text(fill: luma(120))[\[it\]] or disliked #text(fill: luma(120))[\[it\]].
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
