  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  so they disputed His management and criticized His wisdom,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَلم ينقادوا لحكمه وعارضوا حكمه بعقولهم الْفَاسِدَة وآرائهم الْبَاطِلَة وسياساتهم الجائرة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and they did not submit to His ruling, and they opposed His ruling with their corrupt minds, their false opinions, and their unjust policies.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَلَا لرَبهم عرفُوا وَلَا لمصالحهم حصلوا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So neither did they know their Lord, nor did they achieve their interests.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
