  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and its tranquility toward His religious rulings.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَهَذَا هُوَ الرِّضَا بِاللَّه رَبًّا وَبِالْإِسْلَامِ دينا وَبِمُحَمَّدٍ رَسُولا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And this — it #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] contentment with God #text(fill: luma(120))[\[as\]] Lord, with Islam #text(fill: luma(120))[\[as\]] religion, and with Muhammad #text(fill: luma(120))[\[as\]] messenger.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَمَا ذاق طعم الْإِيمَان من لم يحصل لَهُ ذَلِك
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And #text(fill: luma(120))[\[he has\]] not tasted the taste of faith — whoever has not achieved that.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَهَذَا الرِّضَا هُوَ بِحَسب مَعْرفَته بِعدْل الله وحكمته وَرَحمته وَحسن اخْتِيَاره
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And this contentment — it #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] according to his knowledge of the justice of God, His wisdom, His mercy, and the goodness of His choice.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَكلما كَانَ بذلك أعرف كَانَ بِهِ أرْضى
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So the more he knew of that, the more he #text(fill: luma(120))[\[was\]] content with Him.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فقضاء الرب سُبْحَانَهُ فِي عَبده دائر بَين الْعدْل والمصلحة وَالْحكمَة وَالرَّحْمَة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So the decree of the Lord, glorified #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] He, concerning His servant revolves between justice, benefit, wisdom, and mercy.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  لَا يخرج عَن ذَلِك الْبَتَّةَ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  #text(fill: luma(120))[\[It\]] never departs from that at all.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  كَمَا قَالَ فِي الدُّعَاء الْمَشْهُور
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  As he ﷺ said in the well-known supplication:
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
