  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And #text(fill: luma(120))[\[God\]] Most High said:
]

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿اعْلَمُوا أَنَّمَا الْحَيَاةُ الدُّنْيَا لَعِبٌ وَلَهْوٌ وَزِينَةٌ وَتَفَاخُرٌ بَيْنَكُمْ وَتَكَاثُرٌ فِي الْأَمْوَالِ وَالْأَوْلادِ﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  Know that the life of this world #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] only play and amusement and beauty and boasting among you and competition in wealth and children —
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [57:20] — Sahih Intl: Know that the life of this world is but amusement and diversion and adornment and boasting to one another and competition in increase of wealth and children - like the example of a rain whose [resulting] plant growth pleases the tillers; then it dries and you see it turned yellow; then it becomes [scattered] debris. And in the Hereafter is severe punishment and forgiveness from Allah and approval. And what is the worldly life except the enjoyment of delusion.
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿كَمَثَلِ غَيْثٍ أَعْجَبَ الْكُفَّارَ نَبَاتُهُ ثُمَّ يَهِيجُ فَتَرَاهُ مُصْفَرًّا ثُمَّ يَكُونُ حُطَامًا﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  like the example of #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] rain whose plants amazed the farmers, then it dries up and you see it turning yellow, then it becomes broken debris.
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [57:20]
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿وَفِي الْآخِرَةِ عَذَابٌ شَدِيدٌ وَمَغْفِرَةٌ مِنَ اللَّهِ وَرِضْوَانٌ﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  And in the Hereafter #text(fill: luma(120))[\[there is\]] severe punishment and forgiveness from God and #text(fill: luma(120))[\[His\]] pleasure.
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [57:20]
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿وَمَا الْحَيَاةُ الدُّنْيَا إِلَّا مَتَاع الْغرُور﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  And the life of this world #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] nothing but the enjoyment of delusion.
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [57:20]
]
#v(0.15cm)

