  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  "And #text(fill: luma(120))[\[on\]] the day the Hour arrives, the criminals #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] swear they had not stayed more than an hour."
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [30:55] — Sahih Intl: And the Day the Hour appears the criminals will swear they had remained but an hour. Thus they were deluded.
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
