]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿قَالُوا لَبِثْنَا يَوْمًا أَوْ بَعْضَ يَوْمٍ فاسْأَلِ العادِّين﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  "They #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] say, 'We stayed #text(fill: luma(120))[\[for\]] a day or part of a day, so ask those who count.'"
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [23:113] — Sahih Intl: They will say, "We remained a day or part of a day; ask those who enumerate."
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿قَالَ إِنْ لَبِثْتُمْ إِلَّا قَلِيلًا لَوْ أَنَّكُمْ كُنْتُمْ تعلمُونَ﴾﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  "He #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] say, 'You stayed only #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] little — if only you had known.'"
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [23:114] — Sahih Intl: He will say, "You stayed not but a little - if only you had known.
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَقَوله
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And His saying:
