#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿يُنْفَخُ فِي الصُّورِ وَنَحْشُرُ الْمُجْرِمِينَ يَوْمَئِذٍ زُرْقًا﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  "The trumpet #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will be\]] blown, and We #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] gather the criminals that day, blue-eyed."
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [20:102] — Sahih Intl: The Day the Horn will be blown. And We will gather the criminals, that Day, blue-eyed.
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿يَتَخَافَتُونَ بَيْنَهُمْ إِنْ لَبِثْتُمْ إِلَّا عَشْرًا﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  "They #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] whisper among themselves, 'You stayed only ten #text(fill: luma(120))[\[days\]].'"
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [20:103] — Sahih Intl: They will murmur among themselves, "You remained not but ten [days in the world]."
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿نَحْنُ أَعْلَمُ بِمَا يَقُولُونَ إِذْ يَقُولُ أَمْثَلُهُمْ طَرِيقَةً إِنْ لَبِثْتُمْ إِلَّا يَوْمًا﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  "We #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] most knowing of what they say, when the most upright of them in way says, 'You stayed only #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] day.'"
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [20:104] — Sahih Intl: We are most knowing of what they say when the best of them in manner will say, "You remained not but one day."
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَالله الْمُسْتَعَان وَعَلِيهِ التكلان
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And God #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] the One from whom help #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] sought, and upon Him #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] reliance.
]
