#v(0.5cm)
#align(center)[
  #block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 10pt, y: 8pt), stroke: (bottom: 0.4pt + luma(200)))[
    #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 13pt, weight: "bold")
    قاعدة أساس كل خير أن تعلم أن ما شاء الله كان وما لم
    #v(0.15cm)
    #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 10pt, weight: "bold", fill: luma(60))
    A Principle: The Foundation of Every Good [Is] That You Know That Whatever God Willed [Will] Happen and Whatever He Did Not
  ]
]
#v(0.2cm)

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  قَاعِدَة أساس كل خير أَن تعلم أَن مَا شَاءَ الله كَانَ وَمَا لم يَشَأْ لم يكن
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  #text(fill: luma(120))[\[A\]] principle: the foundation of every good #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] that you know that whatever God willed #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] happen, and whatever He did not will #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] not happen.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فتيقن حِينَئِذٍ أَن الْحَسَنَات من نعمه فتشكره عَلَيْهَا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So be certain then that good deeds #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] from His blessings, and you thank Him for them,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وتتضرّع إِلَيْهِ أَن لَا يقطعهَا عَنْك
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and humbly ask Him not to cut them off from you,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَأَن السَّيِّئَات من خذلانه وعقوبته
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and #text(fill: luma(120))[\[know\]] that bad deeds #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] from His abandonment and His punishment,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فتبتهل إِلَيْهِ أَن يحول بَيْنك وَبَينهَا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  so you plead to Him to come between you and them,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَلَا يكلك فِي فعل الْحَسَنَات وَترك السَّيِّئَات إِلَى نَفسك
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and not leave you to yourself in doing good deeds and leaving bad deeds.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَقد أجمع العارفون على أَن كل خير فأصله بِتَوْفِيق الله للْعَبد
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And the knowers have agreed that every good — its origin #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] by God's granting success to the servant,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وكل شَرّ فأصله خذلانه لعَبْدِهِ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and every evil — its origin #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] His abandonment of His servant.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَأَجْمعُوا أَن التَّوْفِيق أَن لَا يكلك الله نفسك
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And they agreed that #text(fill: luma(120))[\[divine\]] success #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] that God does not leave you to yourself,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وان الخذلان أَن يخلي بَيْنك وَبَين نَفسك
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and that abandonment #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] that He leaves you alone with yourself.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَإِذا كَانَ كل خير فأصله التَّوْفِيق وَهُوَ بيد الله لَا بيد العَبْد
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So if every good — its origin #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] #text(fill: luma(120))[\[divine\]] success, and it #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] in God's hand, not in the servant's hand,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فمفتاحه الدُّعَاء والافتقار وَصدق اللجأ وَالرَّغْبَة والرهبة إِلَيْهِ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  then its key #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] supplication, neediness, sincere turning #text(fill: luma(120))[\[to Him\]], hope, and fear of Him.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَمَتَى أعْطى العَبْد هَذَا الْمِفْتَاح فقد أَرَادَ أَن يفتح لَهُ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So whenever the servant #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] given this key, #text(fill: luma(120))[\[God\]] has intended to open for him,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَمَتى أضلّه عَن الْمِفْتَاح بَقِي بَاب الْخَيْر مُرْتَجًا دونه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and whenever He leads him away from the key, the door of good remains shut before him.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  قَالَ أَمِير الْمُؤمنِينَ عمر بن الْخطاب
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  The Commander of the Believers, Umar ibn al-Khattab, said:
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  إِنِّي لَا أحمل هم الْإِجَابَة وَلَكِن هم الدُّعَاء
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  "I do not carry the worry of #text(fill: luma(120))[\[the\]] answer, but #text(fill: luma(120))[\[rather\]] the worry of supplication.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَإِذا ألهمت الدُّعَاء فَإِن الْإِجَابَة مَعَه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  For if I #text(fill: luma(120))[\[am\]] inspired #text(fill: luma(120))[\[with\]] supplication, then the answer #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] with it."
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وعَلى قدر نية العَبْد وهمته وَمرَاده ورغبته فِي ذَلِك يكون توفيقه سُبْحَانَهُ وإعانته
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And according to the measure of the servant's intention, determination, aim, and desire in that #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] His — glorified #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] He — granting success and His help.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فالمعونة من الله تنزل على الْعباد على قدر هممهم وثباتهم ورغبتهم ورهبتهم
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So help from God descends upon the servants according to the measure of their determination, steadfastness, hope, and fear,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  والخذلان ينزل عَلَيْهِم على حسب ذَلِك
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and abandonment descends upon them according to that.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَالله سُبْحَانَهُ أحكم الْحَاكِمين وَأعلم الْعَالمين
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  For God — glorified #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] He — #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] the wisest of judges and the most knowing of #text(fill: luma(120))[\[all\]] who know.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  يضع التَّوْفِيق فِي موَاضعه اللائقة بِهِ والخذلان فِي موَاضعه اللائقة بِهِ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  He places #text(fill: luma(120))[\[divine\]] success in its fitting places, and abandonment in its fitting places.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  هُوَ الْعَلِيم الْحَكِيم
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  He #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] the All-Knowing, the All-Wise.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَمَا أُتِي من أُتِي إِلَّا من قِبَل إِضَاعَة الشُّكْر وإهمال الافتقار وَالدُّعَاء
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And no one who was ruined #text(fill: luma(120))[\[was\]] ruined except because of wasting gratitude and neglecting neediness and supplication.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَلَا ظفر من ظفر بِمَشِيئَة الله وعونه إِلَّا بقيامه بالشكر وَصدق الافتقار وَالدُّعَاء
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And no one who succeeded — by God's will and help — succeeded except by upholding gratitude and sincere neediness and supplication.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وملاك ذَلِك الصَّبْر
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And the foundation of that #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] patience,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَإِنَّهُ من الْإِيمَان بِمَنْزِلَة الرَّأْس من الْجَسَد
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  for it #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] to faith like the position of the head to the body.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَإِذا قطع الرَّأْس فَلَا بَقَاء للجسد
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And if the head #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] cut off, there #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] no survival for the body.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
