#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿﴿كَمَثَلِ الشَّيْطَانِ إِذْ قَالَ لِلْإِنْسَانِ اكْفُرْ فَلَمَّا كَفَرَ قَالَ إِنِّي بَرِيءٌ مِنْكَ إِنِّي أَخَافُ اللَّهَ رَبَّ الْعَالَمِينَ﴾﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  like the parable of Satan, when he said to man: 'Disbelieve!' Then when he disbelieved, he said: 'I #text(fill: luma(120))[\[am\]] free of you; I fear God, Lord of the worlds.'
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [59:16] — Sahih Intl: [The hypocrites are] like the example of Satan when he says to man, "Disbelieve." But when he disbelieves, he says, "Indeed, I am disassociated from you. Indeed, I fear Allah, Lord of the worlds."
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
