  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  the Resurrection — for they grew up in the path of misguidance, disbelief, associating partners #text(fill: luma(120))[\[with God\]], and the paths leading to destruction,
]

