]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وقلب فارغ من محبَّة الله والشوق إِلَيْهِ والأنس بِهِ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] heart empty of the love of God, and longing for Him, and closeness to Him,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وبدن معطل من طَاعَته وخدمته
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] body idle from His obedience and His service,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ومحبة لَا تتقيد برضاء المحبوب وامتثال أوامره
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] love #text(fill: luma(120))[\[that\]] does not bind itself to the pleasure of the Beloved and following His commands,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَوقت معطل عَن اسْتِدْرَاك فارطه أَو اغتنام بر وقربة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] time idle from making up what #text(fill: luma(120))[\[he\]] missed, or seizing #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] good deed and closeness #text(fill: luma(120))[\[to God\]],
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وفكر يجول فِيمَا لَا ينفع
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] thought #text(fill: luma(120))[\[that\]] wanders in what does not benefit,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وخدمة من لَا تقربك خدمته إِلَى الله وَلَا تعود عَلَيْك بصلاح دنياك
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and serving one whose service does not bring you closer to God and does not return to you with benefit in this world of yours,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وخوفك ورجاؤك لمن ناصيته بيد الله وَهُوَ أسير فِي قَبضته
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and your fear and your hope #text(fill: luma(120))[\[being\]] for one whose forelock #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] in the hand of God, and he #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] a captive in His grip,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَلَا يملك لنَفسِهِ حذرا وَلَا نفعا وَلَا موتا وَلَا حَيَاة وَلَا نشورا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and #text(fill: luma(120))[\[he\]] does not possess for himself #text(fill: luma(120))[\[any\]] protection, nor benefit, nor death, nor life, nor resurrection.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَأعظم هَذِه الإضاعات إضاعتان هما أصل كل إِضَاعَة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And the greatest of these losses #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] two losses — they #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] the root of every loss:
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  إِضَاعَة الْقلب وإضاعة الْوَقْت
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  the loss of the heart and the loss of time.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فإضاعة الْقلب من إِيثَار الدُّنْيَا على الْآخِرَة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  The loss of the heart #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] from preferring this world over the Hereafter,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وإضاعة الْوَقْت من طول الأمل
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and the loss of time #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] from long hopes.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَاجْتمع الْفساد كُله فِي إتباع الْهوى وَطول الأمل
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So all corruption gathered in following desire and long hopes,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَالصَّلَاح كُله فى اتِّبَاع الهدى والاستعداد للقاء
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and all righteousness #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] in following guidance and preparing for the meeting #text(fill: luma(120))[\[with God\]].
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَالله الْمُسْتَعَان
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And God #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] the One sought for help.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  الْعجب مِمَّن تعرض لَهُ حَاجَة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  #text(fill: luma(120))[\[How\]] amazing #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is the case\]] of one who #text(fill: luma(120))[\[has\]] a need come to him,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَيصْرف رغبته وهمته فِيهَا إِلَى الله ليقضيها لَهُ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  so he directs his desire and his focus in it to God so that He fulfills it for him,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَلَا يتَصَدَّى للسؤال لحياة قلبه من موت الْجَهْل والإعراض
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  but does not turn to asking for the life of his heart from the death of ignorance and turning away,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وشفائه من دَاء الشَّهَوَات والشبهات
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and its healing from the disease of desires and doubts.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَلَكِن إِذا مَاتَ الْقلب لم يشْعر بمعصيته
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  But when the heart dies, #text(fill: luma(120))[\[it\]] does not feel its disobedience.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فصل
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Section
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  لله سُبْحَانَهُ على عَبده أَمر أمره بِهِ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  God, glorified #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] He, has over His servant a command #text(fill: luma(120))[\[that\]] He commanded him with,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
