  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] decree #text(fill: luma(120))[\[that\]] He decrees upon him,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ونعمة ينعم بهَا عَلَيْهِ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] blessing #text(fill: luma(120))[\[that\]] He blesses him with.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَلَا يَنْفَكّ من هَذِه الثَّلَاثَة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So he #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] never free from these three.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَالْقَضَاء نَوْعَانِ إِمَّا مصائب وَإِمَّا معائب
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And the decree #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] two types: either calamities or faults.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَله عَلَيْهِ عبودية فِي هَذِه الْمَرَاتِب كلهَا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And he owes Him servitude in all of these levels.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَأحب الْخلق إِلَيْهِ من عرف عبوديته فِي هَذِه الْمَرَاتِب ووفاها حَقّهَا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So the most beloved of creation to Him #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] whoever knows his servitude in these levels and fulfills its right.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَهَذَا أقرب الْخلق إِلَيْهِ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So this #text(fill: luma(120))[\[person is\]] the closest of creation to Him,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وأبعدهم مِنْهُ من جهل عبوديته فِي هَذِه الْمَرَاتِب فعطلها علما وَعَملا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and the farthest from Him #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] whoever #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] ignorant of his servitude in these levels, and neglected it in knowledge and action.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فعبوديته فِي الْأَمر وامتثاله اخلاصا واقتداءا برَسُول الله
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So his servitude regarding the command #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] obeying it with sincerity and following the Messenger of God,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَفِي النَّهْي اجتنابه خوفًا مِنْهُ وإجلالا ومحبة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and regarding the prohibition, #text(fill: luma(120))[\[it is\]] avoiding it out of fear of Him, reverence, and love.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وعبوديته فِي قَضَاء المصائب الصَّبْر عَلَيْهَا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And his servitude regarding the decree of calamities #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] patience with them,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ثمَّ الرِّضَا بهَا وَهُوَ أَعلَى مِنْهُ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  then contentment with them, and it #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] higher than it,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ثمَّ الشُّكْر عَلَيْهَا وَهُوَ أَعلَى من الرِّضَا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  then gratitude for them, and it #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] higher than contentment.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَهَذَا إِنَّمَا يأتى مِنْهُ إِذا تمكن حبه من قلبه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And this only comes from him when His love takes hold of his heart,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
