  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَلَا تزيده النعم إِلَّا انكسارا وذلا وتواضعا ومحبة للمنعم
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So blessings do not increase him except #text(fill: luma(120))[\[in\]] brokenness, humility, lowliness, and love for the One who blessed #text(fill: luma(120))[\[him\]].
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَكلما جدد لَهُ نعْمَة أحدث لَهَا عبودية ومحبة وخضوعا وذلا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And whenever He renewed for him #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] blessing, he produced for it servitude, love, submission, and humility.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَكلما أحدث لَهُ قبضا أحدث لَهُ رضى
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And whenever He brought about for him #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] hardship, he produced contentment.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَكلما أحدث ذَنبا أحدث لَهُ تَوْبَة وانكسارا واعتذارا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And whenever he committed #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] sin, he produced repentance, brokenness, and seeking pardon.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَهَذَا هُوَ العَبْد الكيّس
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So this — he #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] the clever servant,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَالْعَاجِز بمعزل عَن ذَلِك وَبِاللَّهِ التَّوْفِيق
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and the helpless #text(fill: luma(120))[\[one is\]] far removed from that. And with God #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] success.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  من ترك الِاخْتِيَار وَالتَّدْبِير فِي رَجَاء زِيَادَة أَو خوف نُقْصَان أَو طلب صِحَة أَو فرار من سقم
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Whoever leaves choice and planning — in hope of increase, or fear of decrease, or seeking health, or fleeing from illness —
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَعلم أَن الله على كل شَيْء قدير
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and knows that God #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] capable over all things,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَأَنه المتفرد بِالِاخْتِيَارِ وَالتَّدْبِير
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and that He #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] the One alone in choice and planning,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَأَن تَدْبيره لعَبْدِهِ خير من تَدْبِير العَبْد لنَفسِهِ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and that His planning for His servant #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] better than the servant's planning for himself,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَأَنه أعلم بمصلحته من العَبْد
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and that He #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] more knowing of what #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] good for him than the servant,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وأقدر على جلبها وتحصيلها مِنْهُ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and more capable of bringing it and achieving it than him,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وأنصح للْعَبد مِنْهُ لنَفسِهِ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and more sincere to the servant than he #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] to himself,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وأرحم مِنْهُ بِنَفسِهِ وَأبر بِهِ مِنْهُ بِنَفسِهِ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and more merciful than he #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] to himself, and more caring of him than he #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] of himself,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَعلم مَعَ ذَلِك أَنه لَا يَسْتَطِيع أَن يتَقَدَّم بَين يَدي تَدْبيره خطْوَة وَاحِدَة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and knows along with that, that he cannot advance ahead of His planning #text(fill: luma(120))[\[by\]] #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] single step,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَلَا يتَأَخَّر عَن تَدْبيره لَهُ خطْوَة وَاحِدَة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  nor fall behind His planning for him #text(fill: luma(120))[\[by\]] #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] single step —
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَلَا مُتَقَدم لَهُ بَين يَدي قَضَائِهِ وَقدره وَلَا يتَأَخَّر
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  so there #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] no getting ahead of His decree and destiny, nor falling behind —
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَألْقى نَفسه بَين يَدَيْهِ وَسلم الْأَمر كُله إِلَيْهِ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  so he threw himself before Him and surrendered the matter — all of it — to Him,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وانطرح بَين يَدَيْهِ انطراح عبد مَمْلُوك ضعف بَين يَدي ملك عَزِيز قاهر
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and he fell down before Him — the falling of #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] weak owned slave before #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] mighty, overpowering king,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  لَهُ التَّصَرُّف فِي عَبده بِكُل مَا يَشَاء
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  who has the right to deal with his slave in whatever he wills,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَلَيْسَ للْعَبد التَّصَرُّف فِيهِ بِوَجْه من الْوُجُوه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and the slave has no right to deal with him in any way —
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فاستراح حِينَئِذٍ من الهموم والغموم والأنكاد والحسرات
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  so he found rest then from the worries, sorrows, troubles, and regrets.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَحمل كُله حَوَائِجه ومصالحه من لَا يُبَالِي بحملها وَلَا يثقله وَلَا يكترث بهَا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And the One who #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] not burdened by carrying them, nor #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] weighed down, nor troubled by them, carried all of his needs and interests.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فتولاها دونه وَأرَاهُ لطفه وبره وَرَحمته وإحسانه فِيهَا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So He took charge of them instead of him, and showed him His kindness, goodness, mercy, and generosity in them,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  من غير تَعب من العَبْد وَلَا نصب وَلَا اهتمام مِنْهُ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  without tiredness from the servant, nor fatigue, nor concern from him —
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  لِأَنَّهُ قد صرف اهتمامه كُله إِلَيْهِ وَجعله وَحده همه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  because he had directed all his concern to Him and made Him alone his focus.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فصرف عَنهُ اهتمامه بحوائجه ومصالح دُنْيَاهُ وَفرغ قلبه مِنْهَا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So He turned away from him his concern with his needs and the interests of this world, and freed his heart from them.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَمَا أطيب عيشه وَمَا أنعم قلبه وَأعظم سروره وفرحه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So how sweet #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] his life! And how comfortable #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] his heart, and how great #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] his joy and happiness!
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَإِن أَبى إِلَّا تَدْبيره لنَفسِهِ واختياره لَهَا واهتمامه بحظه دون حق ربه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  But if he insists on nothing but his own planning for himself, and his own choosing for it, and his concern with his share rather than the right of his Lord —
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  خلاه وَمَا اخْتَارَهُ وولاه مَا تولى
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  He leaves him to what he chose, and puts him in charge of what he took charge of.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فحضره الْهم وَالْغَم والحزن والنكد الْخَوْف والتعب وكسف البال وَسُوء الْحَال
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So worry, grief, sadness, misery, fear, exhaustion, gloom, and #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] bad state come upon him.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَلَا قلب
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So #text(fill: luma(120))[\[there is\]] no heart —
]
