  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  #text(fill: luma(120))[\[that\]] becomes pure, nor #text(fill: luma(120))[\[any\]] deed #text(fill: luma(120))[\[that\]] grows, nor #text(fill: luma(120))[\[any\]] hope #text(fill: luma(120))[\[that\]] #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] achieved,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَلَا رَاحَة يفوز بهَا وَلَا لَذَّة يتنعم بهَا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  nor #text(fill: luma(120))[\[any\]] rest he wins, nor #text(fill: luma(120))[\[any\]] pleasure he enjoys.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  بل قد حيل بَينه وَبَين مسرته وفرحه وقرة عينه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Rather, #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a barrier\]] has been placed between him and his delight, his happiness, and the coolness of his eyes.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَهُوَ يكدح فِي الدُّنْيَا كدح الْوَحْش وَلَا يظفر مِنْهُ بأمل
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So he toils in this world the toiling of #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] wild animal, and does not gain from it any hope,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَلَا يتزود مِنْهَا لِمَعَاد
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  nor does he gather provisions from it for #text(fill: luma(120))[\[the\]] Return.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَالله سُبْحَانَهُ أَمر العَبْد بِأَمْر وَضمن لَهُ ضمانا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And God, glorified #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] He, commanded the servant with #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] command and guaranteed him #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] guarantee.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَإِن قَامَ بأَمْره بالنصح والصدق وَالْإِخْلَاص وَالِاجْتِهَاد
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So if he fulfilled His command with sincerity, truthfulness, devotion, and striving,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  قَامَ الله سُبْحَانَهُ لَهُ بِمَا ضمنه لَهُ من الرزق والكفاية والنصر وَقَضَاء الْحَوَائِج
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  God, glorified #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] He, fulfilled for him what He guaranteed him of provision, sufficiency, victory, and fulfilling #text(fill: luma(120))[\[of\]] needs.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَإِنَّهُ سُبْحَانَهُ ضمن الرزق لمن عَبده
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  For He, glorified #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] He, guaranteed provision to whoever worshipped Him,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  والنصر لمن توكل عَلَيْهِ واستنصر بِهِ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and victory to whoever relied on Him and sought His help,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  والكفاية لمن كَانَ هُوَ همه وَمرَاده
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and sufficiency to whoever He was his concern and his aim,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَالْمَغْفِرَة لمن استغفره
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and forgiveness to whoever sought His forgiveness,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَقَضَاء الْحَوَائِج لمن صَدَقَه فِي طلبَهَا ووثق بِهِ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and fulfilling #text(fill: luma(120))[\[of\]] needs to whoever was truthful with Him in seeking them, and trusted in Him,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَقَوي رجاؤه وطمعه فِي فَضله وجوده
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and whose hope and longing in His grace and generosity grew strong.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
