  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So the clever, wise #text(fill: luma(120))[\[person\]] only concerns himself with His command, establishing it, and fulfilling it — not with His guarantee.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَإِنَّهُ الوفي الصَّادِق وَمَنْ أَوْفَى بِعَهْدِهِ مِنَ الله
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  For He #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] the Faithful, the Truthful — and who #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] more faithful to his covenant than God?
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
