  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So from the signs of happiness #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] directing one's concern to the command of God, not His guarantee.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَمن عَلَامَات الحرمان فرَاغ قلبه من الاهتمام بأَمْره وحبه وخشيته
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And from the signs of deprivation #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] his heart being empty of concern for His command, His love, and fear of Him,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  والاهتمام بضمانه وَالله الْمُسْتَعَان
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and #text(fill: luma(120))[\[instead\]] being concerned with His guarantee. And God #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] the One whose help #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] sought.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  قَالَ بشر بن الْحَارِث أهل الْآخِرَة ثَلَاثَة عَابِد وزاهد وصِدِّيق
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Bishr ibn al-Harith said: the people of the Hereafter #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] three — #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] worshipper, #text(fill: luma(120))[\[an\]] ascetic, and #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] truthful one.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فالعابد يعبد الله مَعَ العلائق
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  The worshipper worships God while #text(fill: luma(120))[\[having\]] attachments,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  والزاهد يعبده على ترك العلائق
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and the ascetic worships Him upon leaving attachments,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَالصديق يعبده على الرِّضَا والموافقة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and the truthful one worships Him upon contentment and agreement.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  إِن أرَاهُ أَخذ الدُّنْيَا أَخذهَا وَإِن أرَاهُ تَركهَا تَركهَا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  If He showed him #text(fill: luma(120))[\[to\]] take this world, he took it; and if He showed him #text(fill: luma(120))[\[to\]] leave it, he left it.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
