  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And that difficulty becomes easy, and that pain #text(fill: luma(120))[\[becomes\]] pleasure.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَإِن الرب شكور فَلَا بُد أَن يذيقه لَذَّة تحيزه إِلَى الله وَإِلَى رَسُوله
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  For the Lord #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] Grateful, so He must let him taste the pleasure of his taking the side of God and His Messenger.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ويريه كَرَامَة ذَلِك
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And He shows him the honor of that.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
