  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So the blessings produce in him #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] humility and #text(fill: luma(120))[\[an\]] amazing brokenness that cannot be expressed.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَكلما جدد لَهُ نعْمَة ازْدَادَ لَهُ ذلا وانكسارا وخشوعا ومحبة وخوفا ورجاء
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So every time He renews for him #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] blessing, he increases in humility, brokenness, reverence, love, fear, and hope.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
