  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So when these two forms of knowledge become #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] deep quality in it — not #text(fill: luma(120))[\[just a\]] phrase on its tongue —
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  علمت حِينَئِذٍ أَن الْحَمد كُله لله وَالْأَمر كُله لَهُ وَالْخَيْر كُله فِي يَدَيْهِ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  it knows then that all praise #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] for God, all command #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] His, and all good #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] in His hands,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَأَنه هُوَ الْمُسْتَحق للحمد وَالثنَاء والمدح دونهَا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
