  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  For whoever knew himself #text(fill: luma(120))[\[to be characterized\]] by ignorance, wrongdoing, flaw, deficiencies, need, poverty, lowliness, helplessness, and nothingness —
