  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And in the Musnad, attributed #text(fill: luma(120))[\[to the Prophet\]]: "Islam #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] outward, and faith #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] in the heart."
