  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And they saw that the smallest share of the spiritual openings that come upon their hearts from God #text(fill: luma(120))[\[was\]] more beloved to them than many bodily voluntary acts.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
