  فالمعروف عِنْدهم مَا وافقهم وَالْمُنكر مَا خالفها
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So the good to them #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] what agrees with them, and the wrong #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] what opposes them.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَهَذِه الأوضاع والرسوم قد استولت على طوائف بني آدم
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And these practices and customs have taken over groups of the children of Adam —
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  من الْمُلُوك والولاة وَالْفُقَهَاء والصوفية والفقراء والمطوعين والعامة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  from the kings and rulers and scholars of law and Sufis and the poor and the enforcers and the common people.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فربي فِيهَا الصَّغِير وَنَشَأ عَلَيْهَا الْكَبِير واتخذت سننا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So the young were raised in them and the old grew up on them, and they were taken #text(fill: luma(120))[\[as\]] traditions —
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  بل هِيَ أعظم عِنْد أَصْحَابهَا من السّنَن
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  rather, they #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] greater to their people than the #text(fill: luma(120))[\[prophetic\]] traditions.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  الْوَاقِف مَعهَا مَحْبُوس والمتقيّد بهَا مُنْقَطع
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  The one standing with them #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] imprisoned, and the one bound by them #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] cut off.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  عمّ بهَا الْمُصَاب وهجر لأَجلهَا السّنة وَالْكتاب
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Affliction #text(fill: luma(120))[\[has\]] spread through them, and the prophetic practice and the Book #text(fill: luma(120))[\[have been\]] abandoned because of them.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  من استنصر بهَا فَهُوَ عِنْد الله مخذول
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Whoever seeks help through them — he #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] with God forsaken.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَمن اقْتدى بهَا دون كتاب الله وَسنة رَسُوله فَهُوَ عِنْد الله غير مَقْبُول
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And whoever follows them instead of the Book of God and the practice of His Messenger — he #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] with God not accepted.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَهَذِه أعظم الْحجب والموانع بَين العَبْد وَبَين النّفُوذ إِلَى الله وَرَسُوله
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And these #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] the greatest veils and barriers between the servant and between reaching God and His Messenger.
]
