  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Chapter: As for the obstacles, they #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] the types of violations — their outward and inward #text(fill: luma(120))[\[forms\]].
