  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Chapter: As for the attachments, they #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] everything the heart clings to besides God and His Messenger —
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  من ملاذ الدُّنْيَا وشهواتها ورياستها وصحبة النَّاس والتعلق بهم
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  from the pleasures of this world and its desires and its status, and the company of people and clinging to them.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَلَا سَبِيل لَهُ إِلَى قطع هَذِه الْأُمُور الثَّلَاثَة ورفضها إِلَّا بِقُوَّة التَّعَلُّق بالمطلب الْأَعْلَى
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And there #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] no way for him to cut off these three things and abandon them except by the strength of attachment to the highest goal.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَإِلَّا فقطعها عَلَيْهِ بِدُونِ تعلّقه بمطلوبه مُمْتَنع
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Otherwise, cutting them off without his attachment to what he seeks #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] impossible.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَإِن النَّفس لَا تتْرك مألوفها ومحبوبها
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  For the self does not leave what it #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] used to and what it loves
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  إِلَّا لمحبوب هُوَ أحب إِلَيْهَا مِنْهُ وآثر عِنْدهَا مِنْهُ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  except for #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] beloved that #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] more dear to it than that, and more preferred to it than that.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
