]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  والتعلق بالمطلوب هُوَ شدَّة الرَّغْبَة فِيهِ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And attachment to what #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] sought — it #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] the intensity of longing for it.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَذَلِكَ على قدر مَعْرفَته بِهِ وشرفه وفضله على مَا سواهُ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And that #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] according to the measure of his knowledge of it, and its nobility, and its superiority over everything else.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
