  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Chapter: When the Messenger perfected the station of neediness to God, glorified #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] He,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  أحْوج الْخَلَائق كلهم إِلَيْهِ فِي الدُّنْيَا وَالْآخِرَة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  #text(fill: luma(120))[\[God\]] made all of creation most in need of him in this world and the Hereafter.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  أما حَاجتهم إِلَيْهِ فِي الدُّنْيَا فأشد من حَاجتهم إِلَى الطَّعَام وَالشرَاب
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  As for their need for him in this world, #text(fill: luma(120))[\[it is\]] greater than their need for food and drink
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
