  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  Is #text(fill: luma(120))[\[the\]] one who founded his building on God-consciousness from God and #text(fill: luma(120))[\[His\]] pleasure better, or #text(fill: luma(120))[\[the\]] one who founded his building on the edge of #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] crumbling cliff, so it collapsed with him into the Fire of Hell?
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
