    #v(0.15cm)
    #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 10pt, weight: "bold", fill: luma(60))
    Section: The Pillars of Disbelief [Are] Four: Arrogance, Envy, Anger, and Desire — Arrogance Prevents Him
  ]
]
#v(0.2cm)

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ثَلَاث خلال إِمَّا أَن يَغْلِبك على الْحصن ويستولي عَلَيْهِ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  three situations: either he overpowers you over the fortress and takes control of it,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَإِمَّا أَن يساكنك فِيهِ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  or he settles in with you inside it,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَإِمَّا أَن يشغلك بمقابلته عَن تَمام مصلحتك
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  or he keeps you busy confronting him, #text(fill: luma(120))[\[away\]] from completing your well-being
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وتعود إِلَى سد النقب وَلم شعث الْحصن
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and #text(fill: luma(120))[\[from\]] returning to seal the breach and repair the damage of the fortress.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَإِذا دخل نقبه إِلَيْك نالك مِنْهُ ثَلَاث آفَات
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And if he enters through his tunnel to you, three harms #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] reach you from him:
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  إِفْسَاد الْحصن والإغارة على حواصله وذخائره
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  ruining the fortress, raiding its supplies and treasures,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَدلَالَة السراق من بني جنسه على عَوْرَته
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and guiding the thieves from his kind to its weak points.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَلَا يزَال يبْلى مِنْهُ بغارة حَتَّى يضعفوا قواه ويوهنوا عزمه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So he keeps being afflicted by him with raids until they weaken his strength and break his resolve,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فيتخلى عَن الْحصن ويخلي بَينهم وَبَينه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  so he abandons the fortress and leaves #text(fill: luma(120))[\[the way open\]] between them and it.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَهَذِه حَال أَكثر النُّفُوس مَعَ هَذَا الْعَدو
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And this #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] the condition of most souls with this enemy.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَلِهَذَا تراهم يسخطون رَبهم بِرِضا أنفسهم
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And for this #text(fill: luma(120))[\[reason\]] you see them angering their Lord to please themselves,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  بل بِرِضا مَخْلُوق مثلهم لَا يملك لَهُم ضرا وَلَا نفعا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  rather, to please #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] created being like them #text(fill: luma(120))[\[who\]] does not possess for them #text(fill: luma(120))[\[any\]] harm or benefit.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ويضيعون كسب الدّين بكسب الْأَمْوَال
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And they waste the earnings of religion for the earnings of wealth,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَيهْلِكُونَ أنفسهم بِمَا لَا يبْقى لَهُم
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and they destroy themselves with what does not last for them.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ويحرصون على الدُّنْيَا وَقد أَدْبَرت عَنْهُم
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And they cling to this world while it has turned away from them,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ويزهدون فِي الْآخِرَة وَقد هجمت عَلَيْهِم
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and they have no interest in the Hereafter while it has come upon them.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ويخالفون رَبهم باتّباع أهوائهم
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And they disobey their Lord by following their desires,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ويتكلون على الْحَيَاة وَلَا يذكرُونَ الْمَوْت
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and they rely on life and do not remember death.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ويذكرون شهواتهم وحظوظهم وينسون مَا عهد الله إِلَيْهِم
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And they remember their pleasures and their shares and forget what God entrusted to them.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ويهتمون بِمَا ضمنه الله وَلَا يهتمون بِمَا أَمرهم بِهِ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And they worry about what God #text(fill: luma(120))[\[has\]] guaranteed, and do not worry about what He commanded them with.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ويفرحون بالدنيا ويحزنون على فَوَات حظهم مِنْهَا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And they rejoice in this world and grieve over missing their share of it,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَلَا يَحْزَنُونَ على فَوَات الْجنَّة وَمَا فِيهَا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and they do not grieve over missing Paradise and what #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] in it.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَلَا يفرحون بِالْإِيمَان فَرَحهمْ بالدرهم وَالدِّينَار
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And they do not rejoice in faith #text(fill: luma(120))[\[the way\]] they rejoice in #text(fill: luma(120))[\[the\]] dirham and #text(fill: luma(120))[\[the\]] dinar.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ويفسدون حَقهم وهداهم بضلالهم
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
