]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فقد حكم قلبه عقله وإيمانه على نَفسه وشيطانه وحكّم رشده على غيّه وهداه على هَوَاهُ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  then his heart has given authority #text(fill: luma(120))[\[to\]] his intellect and his faith over his self and his devil, and given authority #text(fill: luma(120))[\[to\]] his right guidance over his misguidance, and his guidance over his desire.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
