  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And know that passing thoughts and whisperings deliver what #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] attached to them to reflection, then reflection takes them and delivers them to recollection,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فيأخذها الذّكر فيؤديها إِلَى الْإِرَادَة فتأخذها الْإِرَادَة فتؤديها إِلَى الْجَوَارِح وَالْعَمَل
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  then recollection takes them and delivers them to the will, then the will takes them and delivers them to the limbs and action.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فتستحكم فَتَصِير عَادَة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Then they become firmly rooted and turn into #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] habit.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
