  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So the thoughts and ideas that roam in the self — they #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] like the grain that #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] placed in the millstone.
