#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَحِينَئِذٍ يُبَادر إِلَى إِلْقَاء مَا مَعَه فِيهَا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So then he rushes to throw what he has into it.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَبِالْجُمْلَةِ فقيم الرحا إِذا تخلى عَنْهَا وَعَن إصلاحها وإلقاء الْحبّ النافع فِيهَا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And in summary, the keeper of the mill — when he abandons it and #text(fill: luma(120))[\[abandons\]] repairing it and throwing beneficial grain into it —
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وجد الْعَدو السَّبِيل إِلَى إفسادها وإرادتها بِمَا مَعَه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  the enemy finds the way to corrupting it and running it with what he has.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وأصل صَلَاح هَذِه الرَّحَى بالاشتغال بِمَا يَعْنِيك
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And the root of the soundness of this mill #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] in occupying #text(fill: luma(120))[\[yourself\]] with what concerns you,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وفسادها كُله فِي الِاشْتِغَال بِمَا لَا يَعْنِيك
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and all its corruption #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] in occupying #text(fill: luma(120))[\[yourself\]] with what does not concern you.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَمَا أحسن مَا قَالَ بعض الْعُقَلَاء
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And how excellent #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] what some wise people said:
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  لما وجدت أَنْوَاع الذَّخَائِر مَنْصُوبَة غَرضا للمتألف
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  "When I found the types of treasures set up #text(fill: luma(120))[\[as\]] a target for ruin,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَرَأَيْت الزَّوَال حَاكما عَلَيْهَا مدْركا لَهَا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and I saw decline ruling over them, overtaking them,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  انصرفت عَن جَمِيعهَا إِلَى مَا لَا يُنَازع فِيهِ الحجا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  I turned away from all of them toward what the intellect does not dispute
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  أَنه أَنْفَع الذَّخَائِر وَأفضل المكاسب وأربح المتاجر
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  — that it #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] the most beneficial of treasures, the best of earnings, and the most profitable of trades."
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَالله الْمُسْتَعَان
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And God #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] the One whose help #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] sought.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  قَالَ شَقِيق بن إِبْرَاهِيم
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Shaqiq ibn Ibrahim said:
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  أغلق بَاب التَّوْفِيق عَن الْخلق من سِتَّة أَشْيَاء
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  "The door of divine guidance was closed upon creation because of six things:
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  اشتغالهم بِالنعْمَةِ عَن شكرها
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  their preoccupation with blessings instead of being grateful for them,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ورغبتهم فِي الْعلم وتركهم الْعَمَل
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and their desire for knowledge while abandoning action,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  والمسارعة إِلَى الذَّنب وَتَأْخِير التَّوْبَة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and rushing toward sin and delaying repentance,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  والاغترار بِصُحْبَة الصَّالِحين وَترك الِاقْتِدَاء بفعالهم
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and being fooled by the company of the righteous while abandoning following their deeds,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وإدبار الدُّنْيَا عَنْهُم وهم يتبعونها
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and this world turning away from them while they chase it,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وإقبال الْآخِرَة عَلَيْهِم وهم معرضون عَنْهَا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and the Hereafter approaching them while they turn away from it."
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  قلت وأصل ذَلِك عدم الرَّغْبَة والرهبة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  I say: the root of that #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] the lack of desire and fear,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَأَصله ضعف الْيَقِين
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and its root #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] the weakness of certainty,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَأَصله ضعف البصيرة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and its root #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] the weakness of insight,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَأَصله مهانة النَّفس ودناءتها
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and its root #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] the lowliness of the self and its baseness,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  واستبدال الَّذِي هُوَ أدنى بِالَّذِي هُوَ خير
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and exchanging that which #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] lower for that which #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] better.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَإِلَّا فَلَو كَانَت النَّفس شريفة كَبِيرَة لم ترض بالدون
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Otherwise, if the self were noble #text(fill: luma(120))[\[and\]] great, it would not be content with what #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] lesser.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَأصل الْخَيْر كُله بِتَوْفِيق الله ومشيئته وَشرف النَّفس ونبلها وكبرها
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So the root of all good — by God's guidance and #text(fill: luma(120))[\[His\]] will — #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] the nobility of the self, its honor, and its greatness,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وأصل الشَّرّ خستها ودناءتها وصغرها
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and the root of evil #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] its lowliness, its baseness, and its smallness.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  قَالَ تَعَالَى
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  #text(fill: luma(120))[\[God\]] Most High said:
]

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿قَدْ أَفْلح من زكاها﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  He has succeeded — whoever purified it.
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [91:9]
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿وَقد خَابَ من دساها﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  And he has failed — whoever corrupted it.
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [91:10]
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  أَي أَفْلح من كبرها وكثرها ونماها بِطَاعَة الله
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Meaning: he succeeded who made it great and increased it and grew it through obedience to God,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وخاب من صغرها وحقرها بمعاصي الله
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and he failed who made it small and belittled it through disobedience to God.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فالنفوس الشَّرِيفَة لَا ترْضى من الْأَشْيَاء إِلَّا بِأَعْلَاهَا وأفضلها وأحمدها عَاقِبَة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So the noble souls #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] not content with things except the highest of them, the best of them, and the most praiseworthy of them in outcome.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  والنفوس الدنيئة تحوم حول الدناءات وَتَقَع عَلَيْهَا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And the lowly souls circle around lowly things and fall upon them,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  كَمَا يَقع الذُّبَاب على الأقذار
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  just as flies fall upon filth.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَالنَّفْس الشَّرِيفَة الْعلية لَا ترْضى بالظلم وَلَا بالفواحش وَلَا بِالسَّرقَةِ والخيانة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So the noble, lofty self #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] not content with injustice, nor with shameful deeds, nor with theft and betrayal,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  لِأَنَّهَا أكبر من ذَلِك وأجلّ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  because it #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] greater than that and more dignified.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَالنَّفس المهينة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And the lowly self —
]
