  ]
]
#v(0.2cm)

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  الحقيرة والخسيسة بالضد من ذَلِك
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  the lowly and base #text(fill: luma(120))[\[ones are\]] the opposite of that.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَكل نفس تميل إِلَى مَا يُنَاسِبهَا ويشاكلها
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So every soul inclines toward what suits it and resembles it.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَهَذَا معنى قَوْله تَعَالَى
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And this #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] the meaning of #text(fill: luma(120))[\[God\]] Most High's saying:
]

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿قُلْ كُلٌّ يَعْمَلُ عَلَى شَاكِلَتِهِ﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  Say: each acts according to his nature.
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [17:84] — Sahih Intl: Say, "Each works according to his manner, but your Lord is most knowing of who is best guided in way."
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  أَي على مَا يشاكله ويناسبه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  meaning, according to what resembles him and suits him.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَهُوَ يعْمل على طَرِيقَته الَّتِي تناسب أخلاقه وطبيعته
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So he acts along his way that suits his character and nature.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وكل إِنْسَان يجْرِي على طَرِيقَته ومذهبه وعادته الَّتِي ألفها وجبل عَلَيْهَا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And every person runs along his way, his path, and his habit that he grew used to and was shaped upon.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فالفاجر يعْمل بِمَا يشبه طَرِيقَته من مُقَابلَة النعم بِالْمَعَاصِي والإعراض عَن النعم
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So the sinful one acts according to what resembles his way — of meeting blessings with sins and turning away from blessings.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَالْمُؤمن يعْمل بِمَا يشاكله من شكر النعم ومحبته وَالثنَاء عَلَيْهِ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
