#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿مَا كَانُوا لِيُؤْمِنُوا إِلَّا أَنْ يَشَاءَ اللَّهُ﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  they would not have believed — unless God willed.
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [6:111]
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  والعاقل الْمُؤَيد بالتوفيق يعْتَبر بِدُونِ هَذَا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And the wise one, supported with #text(fill: luma(120))[\[divine\]] success, takes #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] lesson from less than this,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَيتم نقائص خلقته بفضائل أخلاقه وأعماله
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and completes the deficiencies of his creation with the virtues of his character and deeds.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَكلما امتحى من جثمانه أثر زَاد إيمَانه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So whenever #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] trace #text(fill: luma(120))[\[was\]] erased from his body, his faith increased,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَكلما نقص من قوى بدنه زَاد فِي قُوَّة إيمَانه ويقينه ورغبته فِي الله وَالدَّار الْآخِرَة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and whenever his bodily strength decreased, #text(fill: luma(120))[\[it\]] increased in the strength of his faith, his certainty, and his longing for God and the Hereafter.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَإِن لم يكن هَكَذَا فالموت خير لَهُ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And if #text(fill: luma(120))[\[he\]] was not like this, then death #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] better for him,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  لِأَنَّهُ يقف بِهِ على حد معِين من الْأَلَم وَالْفساد
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  because it stops him at #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] set limit of pain and corruption,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  بِخِلَاف الْعُيُوب والنقائص مَعَ طول الْعُمر
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  unlike faults and deficiencies with #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] long life,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَإِنَّهَا زِيَادَة فِي ألمه وهمّه وغمّه وحسرته
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  for they #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] an increase in his pain, his worry, his grief, and his regret.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَإِنَّمَا حسن طول الْعُمر ونفع ليحصل التذكّر والاستدراك واغتنام الْغَرَض وَالتَّوْبَة النصوح
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] long life #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] only good and beneficial so that remembering, making amends, seizing the opportunity, and sincere repentance may happen,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  كَمَا قَالَ تَعَالَى
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  as #text(fill: luma(120))[\[God\]] Most High said:
]

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿أولم نعمّركم مَا يتذكّر فِيهِ من تذكّر﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  Did We not give you #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] life long enough for whoever would remember to remember in it?
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [35:37] — Sahih Intl: And they will cry out therein, "Our Lord, remove us; we will do righteousness - other than what we were doing!" But did We not grant you life enough for whoever would remember therein to remember, and the warner had come to you? So taste [the punishment], for there is not for the wrongdoers any helper.
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَمن لم يورثه التَّعْمِير وَطول الْبَقَاء إصْلَاح معائبه وتدارك فارطه واغتنام بقيّة أنفاسه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So whoever #text(fill: luma(120))[\[was\]] not led by long life and length of remaining to fix his faults, make up for what he missed, and seize the rest of his breaths,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَيعْمل على حَيَاة قلبه وَحُصُول النَّعيم الْمُقِيم
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  working for the life of his heart and the gaining of lasting bliss —
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَإِلَّا فَلَا خير لَهُ فِي حَيَاته
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  then #text(fill: luma(120))[\[there is\]] no good for him in his life.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَإِن العَبْد على جنَاح سفر
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  For the servant #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] on the wing of #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] journey —
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  إِمَّا إِلَى الْجنَّة وَإِمَّا إِلَى النَّار
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  either to Paradise or to the Fire.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَإِذا طَال عمره وَحسن عمله كَانَ طول سَفَره زِيَادَة لَهُ فِي حُصُول النَّعيم واللذة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So if his life #text(fill: luma(120))[\[was\]] long and his deeds #text(fill: luma(120))[\[were\]] good, then the length of his journey #text(fill: luma(120))[\[was\]] an increase for him in gaining bliss and pleasure.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَإِنَّهُ كلما طَال السّفر أَيهَا كَانَت الصبابة أجلّ وَأفضل
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  For whenever the journey #text(fill: luma(120))[\[was\]] longer, the longing #text(fill: luma(120))[\[was\]] greater and finer.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَإِذا طَال عمره وساء عمله كَانَ طول سَفَره زِيَادَة فِي ألمه وعذابه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And if his life #text(fill: luma(120))[\[was\]] long and his deeds #text(fill: luma(120))[\[were\]] bad, then the length of his journey #text(fill: luma(120))[\[was\]] an increase in his pain and punishment,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ونزولا لَهُ إِلَى أَسْفَل
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] descent for him to #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] lower #text(fill: luma(120))[\[place\]].
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فالمسافر إِمَّا صاعد وَإِمَّا نَازل
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So the traveler #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] either ascending or descending.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَفِي الحَدِيث الْمَرْفُوع
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And in the raised hadith:
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  خَيركُمْ من طَال عمره وَحسن عمله
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  "The best of you #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] the one whose life #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] long and whose deeds #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] good,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وشرّكم من طَال عمره وقبيح عمله
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and the worst of you #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] the one whose life #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] long and whose deeds #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] ugly."
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فالطالب الصَّادِق فِي طلبه كَمَا خرب شَيْء من ذَاته جعله عمَارَة لِقَلْبِهِ وروحه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So the sincere seeker in his seeking — whenever something of his self #text(fill: luma(120))[\[was\]] ruined, he made it #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] building up of his heart and spirit.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَكلما نقص شَيْء من دُنْيَاهُ جعله زِيَادَة فِي آخرته
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And whenever something decreased from this world of his, he made it an increase in his Hereafter.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَكلما منع شَيْئا من لذّات دُنْيَاهُ جعله زِيَادَة فِي لذّات آخرته
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And whenever he #text(fill: luma(120))[\[was\]] denied something of the pleasures of this world, he made it an increase in the pleasures of his Hereafter.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَكلما ناله هم أَو حزن أَو غم جعله فِي أفراح آخرته
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And whenever worry, sadness, or grief reached him, he placed it among the joys of his Hereafter.
]
