]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ثمَّ يسْتَغْرق فِي ذَلِك حَتَّى يجد كل شَيْء مِنْهُ ذَاكِرًا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Then he becomes absorbed in that until he finds every part of him remembering.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَأفضل الذّكر وأنفعه مَا واطأ فِيهِ الْقلب اللِّسَان
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And the best remembrance and the most beneficial #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] that in which the heart agrees with the tongue,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
