  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  The most beneficial of people to you #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] a man #text(fill: luma(120))[\[who\]] gave you access to himself so that you plant good in him,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  أَو تصنع إِلَيْهِ مَعْرُوفا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  or do #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] kindness to him.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَإِنَّهُ نعم العون لَك على منفعتك وكمالك
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  For he #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] the best helper for you toward your benefit and your completeness.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فانتفاعك بِهِ فِي الْحَقِيقَة مثل انتفاعه بك أَو أَكثر
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So your benefit from him in reality #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] like his benefit from you, or more.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وأضر النَّاس عَلَيْك من مكّن نَفسه مِنْك حَتَّى تَعْصِي الله فِيهِ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And the most harmful of people to you #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] whoever gained power over you so that you disobey God through him.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَإِنَّهُ عون لَك على مضرّتك ونقصك
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  For he #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] helper for you toward your harm and your deficiency.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  اللَّذَّة المحرّمة ممزوجة بالقبح حَال تنَاولهَا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  The forbidden pleasure #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] mixed with ugliness at the time of taking it,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
