  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And the tiredness from obedience #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] mixed with goodness, producing pleasure and rest.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَإِذا ثقلت على النَّفس ففكر فِي انْقِطَاع تعبها وَبَقَاء حسنها ولذتها وسرورها
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So if it weighs heavy on the self, then think about the end of its tiredness and the lasting of its goodness, its pleasure, and its joy.
