  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  The origin of good and evil #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] from thinking, for thought #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] the beginning of will and pursuit — in renunciation and abandonment, and in love and hatred.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وأنفع الْفِكر الْفِكر فِي مصَالح الْمعَاد وَفِي طرق اجتلابها
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And the most beneficial thought #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] thinking about the interests of the Return and the ways to bring them about,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَفِي دفع مفاسد الْمعَاد وَفِي طرق اجتنابها
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and about warding off the harms of the Return and the ways to avoid them.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَهَذِهِ أَرْبَعَة أفكار هِيَ أجلّ الأفكار
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So these #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] four thoughts — they #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] the noblest of thoughts.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ويليها أَرْبَعَة فكّر فِي مصَالح الدُّنْيَا وطرق تَحْصِيلهَا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And after them #text(fill: luma(120))[\[come\]] four #text(fill: luma(120))[\[more\]]: thinking about the interests of this world and the ways to achieve them,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وفكّر فِي مفاسد الدُّنْيَا وطرق الِاحْتِرَاز مِنْهَا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and thinking about the harms of this world and the ways to guard against them.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فعلى هَذِه الْأَقْسَام الثَّمَانِية دارت أفكار الْعُقَلَاء
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  So upon these eight categories the thoughts of the wise revolve.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَرَأس الْقسم الأول الْفِكر فِي آلَاء الله ونعمه وَأمره وَنَهْيه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And the head of the first category #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] thinking about the blessings of God and His favors, and His commands and His prohibitions,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وطرق الْعلم بِهِ وبأسمائه وَصِفَاته من كِتَابه وَسنة نبيه وَمَا ولاهما
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and the paths of knowledge of Him, and of His names and attributes, from His Book and the way of His Prophet and what follows them.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَهَذَا الْفِكر يُثمر لصَاحبه الْمحبَّة والمعرفة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And this thought produces for its companion love and knowledge #text(fill: luma(120))[\[of God\]].
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَإِذا فكر فِي الْآخِرَة وشرفها ودوامها وَفِي الدُّنْيَا وخستها وفنائها
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And when he thinks about the Hereafter and its nobility and permanence, and about this world and its lowliness and passing away,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  أثمر لَهُ ذَلِك الرَّغْبَة فِي الْآخِرَة والزهد فِي الدُّنْيَا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  that produces for him desire for the Hereafter and renunciation of this world.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَكلما فكّر فِي قصر الأمل وضيق الْوَقْت
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And whenever he thinks about the shortness of hope and the narrowness of time,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  أورثه ذَلِك الجدّ وَالِاجْتِهَاد وبذل الوسع فِي اغتنام الْوَقْت
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  that gives him seriousness and striving and putting forth #text(fill: luma(120))[\[his\]] effort in seizing the moment.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَهَذِه الأفكار تعلي همّته وتحييها بعد مَوتهَا وسفولها
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And these thoughts raise his ambition and bring it to life after its death and decline,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وتجعله فِي وَاد وَالنَّاس فِي وَاد
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and place him in #text(fill: luma(120))[\[one\]] valley and the people in #text(fill: luma(120))[\[another\]] valley.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وبإزاء هَذِه الأفكار الأفكار الرَّديئَة الَّتِي تجول فِي قُلُوب أَكثر هَذَا الْخلق
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And opposite these thoughts #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] the bad thoughts that wander in the hearts of most of this creation,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  كالفكر فِيمَا لم يُكَلف الْفِكر فِيهِ وَلَا أعْطى الْإِحَاطَة بِهِ من فضول الْعلم الَّذِي لَا ينفع
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  like thinking about what one was not charged to think about, and was not given the ability to grasp — from excess knowledge that does not benefit.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  كالفكر فِي كَيْفيَّة ذَات الرب وَصِفَاته مِمَّا لَا سَبِيل للعقول إِلَى إِدْرَاكه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  Like thinking about the nature of the Lord's essence and His attributes — #text(fill: luma(120))[\[things\]] that minds have no way to grasp.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَمِنْهَا الْفِكر فِي الصناعات الدقيقة الَّتِي لَا تَنْفَع بل تضر
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And among them #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] thinking about fine crafts that do not benefit but rather cause harm,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  كالفكر فِي الشطرنج والموسيقى وأنواع الأشكال والتصاوير
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  like thinking about chess, music, and types of shapes and images.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَمِنْهَا الْفِكر فِي الْعُلُوم الَّتِي لَو كَانَت صَحِيحَة لم يُعْط الْفِكر فِيهَا النَّفس كمالا وَلَا شرفا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And among them #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] thinking about sciences that, even if they were correct, thinking about them would not give the soul perfection or nobility,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  كالفكر فِي دقائق الْمنطق وَالْعلم الرياضي والطبيعي
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  like thinking about the fine points of logic, mathematics, and natural science,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَأكْثر عُلُوم الفلاسفة الَّتِي لَو بلغ الْإِنْسَان غايتها لم يكمل بذلك وَلم يزك نَفسه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and most of the sciences of the philosophers — which, even if #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] person reached their limit, he would not become complete by that nor purify his soul.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَمِنْهَا الْفِكر فِي الشَّهَوَات
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And among them #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] thinking about desires.
]
