  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and its harm in the outcome of this world — before the Hereafter — #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] many times its joy.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَمِنْهَا الْفِكر فِيمَا لم يكن لَو كَانَ كَيفَ كَانَ يكون
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And among them #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] thinking about what has not happened — if it had happened, how it would be —
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  كالفكر فِيمَا إِذا صَار ملكا أَو وجد كنزا أَو ملك ضَيْعَة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  like thinking about if #text(fill: luma(120))[\[one\]] became a king, or found #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] treasure, or owned #text(fill: luma(120))[\[an\]] estate —
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  مَاذَا يصنع وَكَيف يتصرّف وَيَأْخُذ وَيُعْطِي وينتقم
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  what #text(fill: luma(120))[\[he\]] would do, and how #text(fill: luma(120))[\[he\]] would act, and take, and give, and take revenge,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَنَحْو ذَلِك من أفكار السّفل
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and the like of that, from the thoughts of the lowly.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَمِنْهَا الْفِكر فِي جزيئات أَحْوَال النَّاس
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And among them #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] thinking about the petty details of people's affairs —
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَمَا جراياتهم ومداخلهم ومخارجهم وتوابع ذَلِك
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  their dealings, their ins and outs, and what follows from that —
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  من فكر النُّفُوس المبطلة الفارغة من الله وَرَسُوله وَالدَّار الْآخِرَة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  from the thoughts of idle souls, empty of God and His Messenger and the Abode of the Hereafter.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَمِنْهَا الْفِكر فِي دقائق الْحِيَل وَالْمَكْر الَّتِي يتَوَصَّل بهَا إِلَى أغراضه وهواه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And among them #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] thinking about the fine points of tricks and schemes by which #text(fill: luma(120))[\[one\]] reaches his goals and his desire,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  مُبَاحَة كَانَت أَو مُحرمَة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  whether they were permissible or forbidden.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَمِنْهَا الْفِكر فِي أَنْوَاع الشّعْر وصروفه وأفانينه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And among them #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] thinking about the types of poetry, its forms, and its styles —
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فِي الْمَدْح والهجاء والغزل والمراثي وَنَحْوهَا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  in praise, satire, love poetry, elegies, and the like.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَإِنَّهُ يشغل الْإِنْسَان عَن الْفِكر فِيمَا فِيهِ سعادته وحياته الدائمة
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  For it distracts a person from thinking about what contains his happiness and his lasting life.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَمِنْهَا الْفِكر فِي المقدرات الذهنية الَّتِي لَا وجود لَهَا فِي الْخَارِج
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And among them #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] thinking about mental hypotheticals that have no existence in reality,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَلَا بِالنَّاسِ حَاجَة إِلَيْهَا الْبَتَّةَ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and people have no need for them at all.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَذَلِكَ مَوْجُود فِي كل علم حَتَّى فِي علم الْفِقْه وَالْأُصُول والطب
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And that #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] found in every field of knowledge, even in jurisprudence, legal theory, and medicine.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَكل هَذِه الأفكار مضرّتها أرجح من مَنْفَعَتهَا
