#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿أَحَسِبَ النَّاسُ أَنْ يُتْرَكُوا أَنْ يَقُولُوا آمَنَّا وَهُمْ لَا يُفْتَنُونَ﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  Do people think that they #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] be left #text(fill: luma(120))[\[alone\]] because they say, 'We believe,' while they #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] not tested?
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [29:2] — Sahih Intl: Do the people think that they will be left to say, "We believe" and they will not be tried?
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿وَلَقَدْ فَتَنَّا الَّذِينَ مِنْ قَبْلِهِمْ فَلَيَعْلَمَنَّ اللَّهُ الَّذِينَ صَدَقُوا وَلَيَعْلَمَنَّ الْكَاذِبِينَ﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  And We certainly tested those before them, so God #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] surely know those who #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] truthful, and He #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] surely know the liars.
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [29:3] — Sahih Intl: But We have certainly tried those before them, and Allah will surely make evident those who are truthful, and He will surely make evident the liars.
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿أَمْ حَسِبَ الَّذِينَ يَعْمَلُونَ السَّيِّئَاتِ أَنْ يَسْبِقُونَا سَاءَ مَا يَحْكُمُونَ﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  Or do those who do evil deeds think that they #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] escape Us? How bad #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] what they judge!
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [29:4] — Sahih Intl: Or do those who do evil deeds think they can outrun Us? Evil is what they judge.
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿مَنْ كَانَ يَرْجُو لِقَاءَ اللَّهِ فَإِنَّ أَجَلَ اللَّهِ لَآتٍ وَهُوَ السَّمِيعُ الْعَلِيمُ﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  Whoever hopes for the meeting with God — then indeed the term of God #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] surely coming, and He #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] the All-Hearing, the All-Knowing.
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [29:5] — Sahih Intl: Whoever should hope for the meeting with Allah - indeed, the term decreed by Allah is coming. And He is the Hearing, the Knowing.
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿وَمَنْ جَاهَدَ فَإِنَّمَا يُجَاهِدُ لِنَفْسِهِ إِنَّ اللَّهَ لَغَنِيٌّ عَنِ الْعَالَمِينَ﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  And whoever strives, then he only strives for his own self. Indeed God #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] surely free of need of all the worlds.
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [29:6] — Sahih Intl: And whoever strives only strives for [the benefit of] himself. Indeed, Allah is free from need of the worlds.
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿وَالَّذِينَ آمَنُوا وَعَمِلُوا الصَّالِحَاتِ لَنُكَفِّرَنَّ عَنْهُمْ سَيِّئَاتِهِمْ﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  And those who believe and do righteous deeds — We #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] surely remove from them their evil deeds,
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [29:7] — Sahih Intl: And those who believe and do righteous deeds - We will surely remove from them their misdeeds and will surely reward them according to the best of what they used to do.
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿وَلَنَجْزِيَنَّهُمْ أَحْسَنَ الَّذِي كَانُوا يَعْمَلُونَ﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  and We #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] surely reward them #text(fill: luma(120))[\[with\]] the best of what they used to do.
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [29:7]
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿وَوَصَّيْنَا الْأِنْسَانَ بِوَالِدَيْهِ حُسْنًا﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  And We instructed man to #text(fill: luma(120))[\[treat\]] his parents #text(fill: luma(120))[\[with\]] goodness.
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [29:8]
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿وَإِنْ جَاهَدَاكَ لِتُشْرِكَ بِي مَا لَيْسَ لَكَ بِهِ عِلْمٌ فَلا تُطِعْهُمَا﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  And if they strive against you to make you associate with Me what you have no knowledge of, then do not obey them.
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [29:8] — Sahih Intl: And We have enjoined upon man goodness to parents. But if they endeavor to make you associate with Me that of which you have no knowledge, do not obey them. To Me is your return, and I will inform you about what you used to do.
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿إِلَيَّ مَرْجِعُكُمْ فَأُنَبِّئُكُمْ بِمَا كُنْتُم تعلمُونَ﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  To Me #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] your return, and I #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] inform you of what you used to do.
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [29:8]
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿وَالَّذِينَ آمَنُوا وَعَمِلُوا الصَّالِحَاتِ لَنُدْخِلَنَّهُمْ فِي الصَّالِحِينَ﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  And those who believe and do righteous deeds — We #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] surely enter them among the righteous.
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [29:9] — Sahih Intl: And those who believe and do righteous deeds - We will surely admit them among the righteous [into Paradise].
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿وَمِنَ النَّاسِ مَنْ يَقُولُ آمَنَّا بِاللَّهِ فَإِذَا أُوذِيَ فِي اللَّهِ جَعَلَ فِتْنَةَ النَّاسِ كَعَذَابِ اللَّهِ﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  And among people #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is he\]] who says, 'We believe in God,' but when he #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] harmed for #text(fill: luma(120))[\[the sake of\]] God, he makes the trial of people like the punishment of God.
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [29:10] — Sahih Intl: And of the people are some who say, "We believe in Allah," but when one [of them] is harmed for [the cause of] Allah, they consider the trial of the people as [if it were] the punishment of Allah. But if victory comes from your Lord, they say, "Indeed, We were with you." Is not Allah most knowing of what is within the breasts of all creatures?
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿وَلَئِنْ جَاءَ نَصْرٌ مِنْ رَبِّكَ لَيَقُولُنَّ إِنَّا كُنَّا مَعكُمْ﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  And if victory comes from your Lord, they #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] surely say, 'Indeed, we were with you.'
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [29:10]
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿أَو لَيْسَ اللَّهُ بِأَعْلَمَ بِمَا فِي صُدُورِ الْعَالَمِينَ﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  #text(fill: luma(120))[\[Is\]] God not most knowing of what #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] in the chests of #text(fill: luma(120))[\[all\]] the worlds?
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [29:10]
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿وَلَيَعْلَمَنَّ اللَّهُ الَّذِينَ آمَنُوا وَلَيَعْلَمَنَّ الْمُنَافِقِينَ﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  And God #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] surely know those who believe, and He #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] surely know the hypocrites.
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [29:11] — Sahih Intl: And Allah will surely make evident those who believe, and He will surely make evident the hypocrites.
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
