  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [2:214] — Sahih Intl: Or do you think that you will enter Paradise while such [trial] has not yet come to you as came to those who passed on before you? They were touched by poverty and hardship and were shaken until [even their] messenger and those who believed with him said, "When is the help of Allah?" Unquestionably, the help of Allah is near.
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿حَتَّى يَقُولَ الرَّسُولُ وَالَّذِينَ آمَنُوا مَعَهُ مَتَى نَصْرُ اللَّهِ﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  until the Messenger and those who believed with him said, 'When #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] the help of God #text(fill: luma(120))[\[come\]]?'
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [2:214]
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿أَلا إِنَّ نَصْرَ اللَّهِ قريب﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  Indeed, the help of God #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] near.
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [2:214]
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَقَالَ الله تَعَالَى لما ذكر الْمُرْتَد وَالْمكْره بقوله
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And God Most High said — when He mentioned the one who turned back and the one who #text(fill: luma(120))[\[was\]] forced — in His saying:
]

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿مَنْ كَفَرَ بِاللَّهِ مِنْ بعد إيمَانه﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  Whoever disbelieved in God after his faith —
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
