]

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿قَالَ تَعَالَى إِنَّا جَعَلْنَا مَا عَلَى الْأَرْضِ زِينَةً لَهَا لِنَبْلُوَهُمْ أَيُّهُمْ أَحْسَنُ عَمَلًا﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  #text(fill: luma(120))[\[God\]] Most High said: "Indeed, We made what #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] on the earth #text(fill: luma(120))[\[as\]] adornment for it, to test them #text(fill: luma(120))[\[as to\]] which of them #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] best in deeds"
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [18:7] — Sahih Intl: Indeed, We have made that which is on the earth adornment for it that We may test them [as to] which of them is best in deed.
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿وَقَالَ تَعَالَى وَبَلَوْنَاهُمْ بِالْحَسَنَاتِ وَالسَّيِّئاتِ لَعَلَّهُمْ يرجعُونَ﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  And #text(fill: luma(120))[\[God\]] Most High said: "And We tested them with good #text(fill: luma(120))[\[things\]] and bad #text(fill: luma(120))[\[things\]], so that they might return"
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [7:168] — Sahih Intl: And We divided them throughout the earth into nations. Of them some were righteous, and of them some were otherwise. And We tested them with good [times] and bad that perhaps they would return [to obedience].
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿وَقَالَ تَعَالَى فَإِمَّا يَأْتِيَنَّكُمْ مِنِّي هُدىً فَمَنِ اتَّبَعَ هُدَايَ فَلا يَضِلُّ وَلا يَشْقَى﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  And #text(fill: luma(120))[\[God\]] Most High said: "Then if there comes to you from Me guidance, then whoever follows My guidance #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] not go astray and not suffer"
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [20:123] — Sahih Intl: [Allah] said, "Descend from Paradise - all, [your descendants] being enemies to one another. And if there should come to you guidance from Me - then whoever follows My guidance will neither go astray [in the world] nor suffer [in the Hereafter].
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿وَمَنْ أَعْرَضَ عَنْ ذِكْرِي فَإِنَّ لَهُ معيشة ضنكا وَنَحْشُرُهُ يَوْمَ الْقِيَامَةِ أعمى﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  "And whoever turns away from My remembrance, then indeed for him #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is a\]] tight life, and We #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] gather him on the Day of Resurrection blind"
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [20:124] — Sahih Intl: And whoever turns away from My remembrance - indeed, he will have a depressed life, and We will gather him on the Day of Resurrection blind."
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿وَقَالَ تَعَالَى أَمْ حَسِبْتُمْ أَنْ تَدْخُلُوا الْجَنَّةَ وَلَمَّا يَعْلَمِ اللَّهُ الَّذِينَ جَاهَدُوا مِنْكُمْ وَيَعْلَمَ الصَّابِرِينَ﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  And #text(fill: luma(120))[\[God\]] Most High said: "Or did you think you #text(fill: luma(120))[\[would\]] enter Paradise while God has not yet known those among you who struggled, and known the patient ones?"
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [3:142] — Sahih Intl: Or do you think that you will enter Paradise while Allah has not yet made evident those of you who fight in His cause and made evident those who are steadfast?
]
#v(0.15cm)

