  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  This #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] in Aal Imran, and He had said before that in al-Baqarah — most of which #text(fill: luma(120))[\[was\]] revealed before Aal Imran:
]

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿أَمْ حَسِبْتُمْ أَنْ تَدْخُلُوا الْجَنَّةَ وَلَمَّا يَأْتِكُمْ مَثَلُ الَّذِينَ خَلَوْا مِنْ قَبْلِكُمْ﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  "Or did you think you #text(fill: luma(120))[\[would\]] enter Paradise while there has not yet come to you the example of those who passed before you?"
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [2:214] — Sahih Intl: Or do you think that you will enter Paradise while such [trial] has not yet come to you as came to those who passed on before you? They were touched by poverty and hardship and were shaken until [even their] messenger and those who believed with him said, "When is the help of Allah?" Unquestionably, the help of Allah is near.
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿مَسَّتْهُمُ الْبَأْسَاءُ وَالضَّرَّاءُ وَزُلْزِلُوا حَتَّى يَقُولَ الرَّسُولُ وَالَّذِينَ آمَنُوا مَعَهُ مَتَى نَصْرُ اللَّهِ﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  "Hardship and harm touched them and they were shaken, until the Messenger and those who believed with him said: When #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] the help of God #text(fill: luma(120))[\[come\]]?"
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [2:214]
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿أَلا إِنَّ نَصْرَ اللَّهِ قَرِيبٌ﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  "Indeed, the help of God #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] near"
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [2:214]
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَذَلِكَ أَن النَّفس لَا تزكو وَتصْلح حَتَّى تمحص بالبلاء
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And that #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] because the self does not become pure or upright until it #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] refined through trials
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  كالذهب الَّذِي لَا يخلص جيده من رديئه حَتَّى يفتن فِي كبر الامتحان
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  like gold whose good #text(fill: luma(120))[\[part\]] cannot be separated from its bad #text(fill: luma(120))[\[part\]] until it #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] smelted in the furnace of testing
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  إِذْ كَانَت النَّفس جاهلة ظالمة وَهِي منشأ كل شَرّ يحصل للْعَبد
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  since the self #text(fill: luma(120))[\[was\]] ignorant #text(fill: luma(120))[\[and\]] wrongdoing, and it #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] the source of every evil that happens to the servant
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  فَلَا يحصل لَهُ شَرّ إِلَّا مِنْهَا
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  so no evil happens to him except from it
]

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿قَالَ تَعَالَى مَا أَصَابَكَ مِنْ حَسَنَةٍ فَمِنَ اللَّهِ وَمَا أَصَابَكَ مِنْ سَيِّئَةٍ فَمِنْ نَفسك﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  #text(fill: luma(120))[\[God\]] Most High said: "Whatever good reaches you #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] from God, and whatever bad reaches you #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] from yourself"
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [4:79] — Sahih Intl: What comes to you of good is from Allah, but what comes to you of evil, [O man], is from yourself. And We have sent you, [O Muhammad], to the people as a messenger, and sufficient is Allah as Witness.
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿وَقَالَ تَعَالَى أَو لما أَصَابَتْكُم مُصِيبَة من مُصِيبَةٌ قَدْ أَصَبْتُمْ مِثْلَيْهَا قُلْتُمْ أَنَّى هَذَا﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  And #text(fill: luma(120))[\[God\]] Most High said: "And when #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] disaster struck you — #text(fill: luma(120))[\[one\]] you had #text(fill: luma(120))[\[already\]] struck #text(fill: luma(120))[\[them with\]] twice its like — you said: How #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] this?"
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [3:165] — Sahih Intl: Why [is it that] when a [single] disaster struck you [on the day of Uhud], although you had struck [the enemy in the battle of Badr] with one twice as great, you said, "From where is this?" Say, "It is from yourselves." Indeed, Allah is over all things competent.
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿قُلْ هُوَ مِنْ عِنْدِ أَنْفُسِكُمْ﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  "Say: It #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] from yourselves"
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [3:165]
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿﴿وَقَالَ﴾ وَمَا أَصَابَكُمْ من مُصِيبَة فِيمَا كسبت أيدكم وَيَعْفُو عَنْ كَثِيرٍ﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  And #text(fill: luma(120))[\[God\]] said: "And whatever disaster strikes you, #text(fill: luma(120))[\[it is\]] because of what your hands have earned, and He pardons much"
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [42:30] — Sahih Intl: And whatever strikes you of disaster - it is for what your hands have earned; but He pardons much.
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿وَقَالَ تَعَالَى ذَلِكَ بِأَنَّ اللَّهَ لَمْ يَكُ مُغَيِّرًا نِعْمَةً أَنْعَمَهَا عَلَى قَوْمٍ حَتَّى يُغَيِّرُوا مَا بِأَنْفسِهِم﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  And #text(fill: luma(120))[\[God\]] Most High said: "That #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] because God #text(fill: luma(120))[\[would\]] not change #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] blessing He had blessed upon #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] people until they change what #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] in themselves"
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [8:53] — Sahih Intl: That is because Allah would not change a favor which He had bestowed upon a people until they change what is within themselves. And indeed, Allah is Hearing and Knowing.
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿وَإِذا أَرَادَ الله بِقوم سوءا فَلَا مرد لَهُ ومالهم من دونه من وَال﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  "And when God intends evil for #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] people, there #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] no turning it back, and they have no protector besides Him"
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [13:11] — Sahih Intl: For each one are successive [angels] before and behind him who protect him by the decree of Allah. Indeed, Allah will not change the condition of a people until they change what is in themselves. And when Allah intends for a people ill, there is no repelling it. And there is not for them besides Him any patron.
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَقد ذكر عقوبات الْأُمَم من آدم إِلَى آخر وَقت
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And He has mentioned the punishments of the nations from Adam to the last time
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَفِي كل ذَلِك يَقُول إِنَّهُم ظلمُوا أنفسهم فهم الظَّالِمُونَ لَا المظلومون
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and in all of that He says that they wronged themselves — so they #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] the wrongdoers, not the wronged
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَأول من اعْترف بذلك أبواهم
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and the first to admit that #text(fill: luma(120))[\[were\]] their parents
]

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿قَالَا رَبَّنَا ظَلَمْنَا أَنْفُسَنَا وَإِنْ لَمْ تَغْفِرْ لَنَا وَتَرْحَمْنَا لَنَكُونَنَّ من الخاسرين﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  They both said: "Our Lord, we have wronged ourselves, and if You do not forgive us and have mercy on us, we #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] surely be among the losers"
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [7:23] — Sahih Intl: They said, "Our Lord, we have wronged ourselves, and if You do not forgive us and have mercy upon us, we will surely be among the losers."
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَقَالَ لإبليس
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And He said to Iblis:
]

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿لَأَمْلَأَنَّ جَهَنَّمَ مِنْكَ وَمِمَّنْ تَبِعَكَ مِنْهُمْ أَجْمَعِينَ﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  "I #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] surely fill Hell with you and with whoever follows you from among them, all together"
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [38:85] — Sahih Intl: [That] I will surely fill Hell with you and those of them that follow you all together."
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وإبليس إِنَّمَا اتبعهُ الغواة مِنْهُم كَمَا قَالَ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And Iblis — only the misguided among them followed him, as he said:
]

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿فبمَا أَغْوَيْتَنِي لَأُزَيِّنَنَّ لَهُمْ فِي الْأَرْضِ وَلَأُغْوِيَنَّهُمْ أَجْمَعِينَ﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  "Because You have led me astray, I #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] surely make #text(fill: luma(120))[\[things\]] attractive for them on the earth, and I #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will\]] surely lead them all astray"
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [15:39] — Sahih Intl: [Iblees] said, "My Lord, because You have put me in error, I will surely make [disobedience] attractive to them on earth, and I will mislead them all
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿إِلَّا عِبَادَكَ مِنْهُم المخلصين﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  "except Your servants among them, the sincere ones"
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [15:40]
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿وَقَالَ تَعَالَى إِنَّ عِبَادِي﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  And #text(fill: luma(120))[\[God\]] Most High said: "Indeed, My servants—"
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [15:42]
]
#v(0.15cm)
#align(right)[#text(7pt, fill: luma(170))[p. 210]]

// --- Page 208 (vol. page 211) ---


#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿لَيْسَ لَكَ عَلَيْهِمْ سُلْطَانٌ إِلَّا مَنِ اتَّبَعَكَ مِنَ الْغَاوِينَ﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  You have no authority over them, except whoever followed you from the deviants
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [15:42] — Sahih Intl: Indeed, My servants - no authority will you have over them, except those who follow you of the deviators.
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  والغي اتّباع هوى النَّفس
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And deviation #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] following the desire of the self.
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَمَا زَالَ السّلف معترفون بذلك
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And the early #text(fill: luma(120))[\[Muslims\]] continued to acknowledge that,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  كَقَوْل أبي بكر وَعمر وَابْن مَسْعُود
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  like the saying of Abu Bakr, Umar, and Ibn Mas'ud:
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  أَقُول فِيهَا برأيي فَإِن يكن صَوَابا فَمن الله
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  "I say regarding it with my #text(fill: luma(120))[\[own\]] opinion, so if it #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] correct, then #text(fill: luma(120))[\[it is\]] from God,
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَإِن يكن خطأ فمني وَمن الشَّيْطَان وَالله وَرَسُوله بريئان مِنْهُ
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  and if it #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] wrong, then #text(fill: luma(120))[\[it is\]] from me and from Satan, and God and His Messenger #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] free of it."
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَفِي الحَدِيث الإلهي حَدِيث أبي ذَر الَّذِي يرويهِ الرَّسُول عَن ربه ﷿
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And in the divine hadith — the hadith of Abu Dharr — which the Messenger narrates from his Lord, glorified and Most High:
]

#block(width: 100%, below: 0.2cm)[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  يَا عبَادي إِنَّمَا هِيَ أَعمالكُم أحصيها لكم
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  "O My servants, they #text(fill: luma(120))[\[are\]] only your deeds — I count them for you,
