]

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿﴿ادْفَعْ بِالَّتِي هِيَ أحسن فَإِذَا الَّذِي بَيْنَكَ وَبَيْنَهُ عَدَاوَةٌ كَأَنَّهُ وَلِيٌّ حَمِيمٌ﴾﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  Repel #text(fill: luma(120))[\[evil\]] with that which #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] better, and then the one between you and him #text(fill: luma(120))[\[there was\]] hatred #text(fill: luma(120))[\[will become\]] as if he #text(fill: luma(120))[\[were\]] #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] close friend.
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [41:34] — Sahih Intl: And not equal are the good deed and the bad. Repel [evil] by that [deed] which is better; and thereupon the one whom between you and him is enmity [will become] as though he was a devoted friend.
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
