  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  And none #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] granted it except those who were patient, and none #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] granted it except the possessor of #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] great fortune.
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [41:35] — Sahih Intl: But none is granted it except those who are patient, and none is granted it except one having a great portion [of good].
]
#v(0.15cm)

#block(width: 100%, inset: (x: 12pt, y: 6pt), fill: rgb("#f8f6f0"), radius: 3pt, stroke: 0.4pt + luma(220))[
  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  ﴿﴿وَإِمَّا يَنْزَغَنَّكَ مِنَ الشَّيْطَانِ نَزْغٌ فَاسْتَعِذْ بِاللَّهِ إِنَّهُ هُوَ السَّمِيعُ الْعَلِيمُ﴾﴾
  #v(0.08cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(40))
  And if #text(fill: luma(120))[\[a\]] provocation from Satan provokes you, then seek refuge in God. He — He #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] the All-Hearing, the All-Knowing.
  #v(0.06cm)
  #set text(7.5pt, fill: luma(120))
  [41:36] — Sahih Intl: And if there comes to you from Satan an evil suggestion, then seek refuge in Allah. Indeed, He is the Hearing, the Knowing.
]
#v(0.15cm)

