  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  The book #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] completed, and #text(fill: luma(120))[\[all\]] praise #text(fill: luma(120))[\[is\]] for God, first and last.
]

