  #set text(dir: rtl, lang: "ar", font: "Noto Naskh Arabic", 12pt)
  وَصلى الله على رَسُولنَا مُحَمَّد النَّبِي الْأُمِّي وعَلى آله وَصَحبه وتابعيه
  #v(0.04cm)
  #set text(dir: ltr, lang: "en", font: "Noto Sans", 9pt, fill: luma(80))
  And may God send blessings upon our Messenger Muhammad, the unlettered Prophet, and upon his family, his companions, and his followers,
